rulings: ['[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': "Any change to a land\'s type or splicing of text into a land can affect the types of mana a land can produce."}, {\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'Any replacement effects are considered by Reflecting Pool when determining the types of mana a land can produce.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Multiple Reflecting Pools won\'t help each other produce mana. If you control a Reflecting Pool, and all other lands you control either lack mana abilities or are other Reflecting Pools, you may still activate Reflecting Pool\'s ability — it just won\'t produce any mana."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'Reflecting Pool checks the effects of all mana-producing abilities of lands you control, but it doesn\\\'t check their costs. For example, Vivid Crag says "{T}, Remove a charge counter from Vivid Crag: Add one mana of any color." If you control Vivid Crag and Reflecting Pool, you can tap Reflecting Pool for any color of mana. It doesn\\\'t matter whether Vivid Crag has a charge counter on it, and it doesn\\\'t matter whether it\\\'s untapped.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Reflecting Pool doesn\'t care about any restrictions or riders your lands put on the mana they produce, such as Pillar of the Paruns and Hall of the Bandit Lord do. It just cares about types of mana."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'The types of mana are white, blue, black, red, green, and colorless.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2004-10-04\', \'text\': \'The swamps are counted on resolution.\'}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': "The amount of damage dealt to a creature is not bounded by its toughness, and the amount of damage dealt to a player is not bounded by that player\'s life total. For example, if Corrupt deals 6 damage to a 2/2 creature, you\'ll gain 6 life."}, {\'date\': \'2010-08-15\', \'text\': \'The life you gain is equal to the damage dealt by Corrupt, not necessarily to the number of Swamps you control (if some or all of the damage is prevented, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-07-01\', \'text\': \'Corrupt counts any land you control with the subtype Swamp, not just ones named Swamp.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "A face-down creature has a mana value of 0, so Mistmeadow Skulk doesn\'t have protection from it ."}, {\'date\': \'2007-05-01\', \'text\': "While a spell with X in its cost is on the stack, its mana value takes the chosen value of X into account. Mistmeadow Skulk can be chosen as a target for a Blaze (which has mana cost {X}{R}) if X is 0 or 1, for example, but it can\'t be chosen as a target for a Blaze if X is 2 or more."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "The protection ability means the following: - Mistmeadow Skulk can\'t be blocked by creatures with mana value 3 or greater. - Mistmeadow Skulk can\'t be enchanted by Auras with mana value 3 or greater. It also can\'t be equipped by Equipment with mana value 3 or greater. - Mistmeadow Skulk can\'t be targeted by spells with mana value 3 or greater. It also can\'t be targeted by abilities from sources with mana value 3 or greater. - All damage that would be dealt to Mistmeadow Skulk by sources with mana value 3 or greater is prevented."}]', "[{'date': '2007-05-01', 'text': '{B/R}, {T}” is the same as saying “{B}, {T} or {R}, {T}.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "An “unblocked creature” is a creature that attacked and wasn\'t blocked. Creatures aren\'t “blocked” or “unblocked” until the declare blockers step, so activating this ability before then (or after combat ends) will have no effect."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Creatures stop being unblocked as the combat phase ends. However, they\'ll stay 4/1 until turn ends."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'If Inkfathom Witch is attacking and unblocked, it can make itself 4/1.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Inkfathom Witch doesn\'t cause creatures to lose their abilities."}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': "The effect from the ability overwrites other effects that set power and/or toughness if and only if those effects existed before the ability resolved. It will not overwrite effects that modify power or toughness (whether from a static ability, counters, or a resolved spell or ability), nor will it overwrite effects that set power and toughness which come into existence after the ability resolves. Effects that switch the creature\'s power and toughness are always applied after any other power or toughness changing effects, including this one, regardless of the order in which they are created."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "If a creature with an {Q} ability hasn\'t been under your control since your most recent turn began, you can\'t activate that ability, unless the creature has haste."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "If the permanent is already untapped, you can\'t activate its {Q} ability. That\'s because you can\'t pay the “Untap this permanent” cost."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "When you activate an {Q} ability, you untap the creature with that ability as a cost. The untap can\'t be responded to. (The actual ability can be responded to, of course.)"}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "If the ability is activated after the current turn\'s End step has begun, the tokens won\'t be exiled until the next turn\'s End step."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "The enchanted creature\'s power is checked at the time the ability resolves. If the enchanted creature has left the battlefield by then, its last known information is used."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'The tokens will be exiled in the End step even if Elemental Mastery or the enchanted creature has left the battlefield by then.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "If you are unable to cast the card (there are no legal targets for the spell, for example), nothing happens when Memory Plunder resolves, and the card remains in its owner\'s graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "If you cast a card “without paying its mana cost,” you can\'t pay any alternative costs. On the other hand, if the card has additional costs (such as conspire), you may pay those."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "If you want to cast the card, you cast it as part of the resolution of Memory Plunder. Timing restrictions based on the card\'s type are ignored if it\'s a sorcery. Other casting restrictions are not (such as “Cast [this card] only during combat”)."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Knollspine Dragon\'s ability checks only whether damage was dealt. It doesn\'t care whether the player\'s life total also changed for other reasons (such as if the player paid life or gained life). For example, if an opponent was dealt 4 damage and gained 6 life during the turn, that player will have a higher life total than they started the turn with — but Knollspine Dragon\'s ability will let you discard your hand and draw four cards."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "This ability counts the total amount of damage (both combat and noncombat) dealt to the targeted opponent by all sources (including ones you controlled and ones you didn\'t) over the course of the turn. Damage that was prevented or replaced doesn\'t count. Damage that resolved but didn\'t cause loss of life (due to Worship, for example) will count."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "You target an opponent when the ability triggers. You don\'t decide whether you want to discard and draw until the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "The creature\'s controller, not Presence of Gond\'s controller, is the one who can activate the ability, so that\'s the player who will get the token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Advice from the Fae is blue, even if you spend six black mana to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a mana value equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its mana value never changes. Thus, Advice from the Fae has a mana value of 6, even if you spend {U}{U}{U} to cast it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Advice from the Fae by spending {U}{U}{U}, {2}{U}{U}, {4}{U}, or {6}.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you\'ve chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'In a multiplayer game, compare the number of creatures you control with the number of creatures each other player controls. If any single player controls at least as many creatures as you, you get to put only one card into your hand.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Beseech the Queen is black even if you spend six red mana to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a mana value equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its mana value never changes. Thus, Beseech the Queen has a mana value of 6, even if you spend {B}{B}{B} to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Beseech the Queen by spending {B}{B}{B}, {2}{B}{B}, {4}{B}, or {6}.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you’ve chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Flame Javelin is red even if you spend six green mana to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a converted mana cost equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its converted mana cost never changes. Thus, Flame Javelin has a converted mana cost of 6, even if you spend {R}{R}{R} to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Flame Javelin by spending {R}{R}{R}, {2}{R}{R}, {4}{R}, or {6}.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you’ve chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Reaper King is all colors even if you spend ten colorless mana to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a converted mana cost equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its converted mana cost never changes. Thus, Reaper King has a converted mana cost of 10, even if you spend {W}{U}{B}{R}{G} to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Reaper King by spending one mana of each color, {2} and one mana each of four different colors, {4} and one mana each of three different colors, {6} and one mana each of two different colors, {8} and one mana of any color, or {10}.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you’ve chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Spectral Procession is white even if you spend six blue mana to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a converted mana cost equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its converted mana cost never changes. Thus, Spectral Procession has a converted mana cost of 6, even if you spend {W}{W}{W} to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Spectral Procession by spending {W}{W}{W}, {2}{W}{W}, {4}{W}, or {6}.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you’ve chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with a monocolored hybrid mana symbol in its mana cost is each of the colors that appears in its mana cost, regardless of what mana was spent to cast it. Thus, Tower Above is green even if you spend six white mana to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A card with monocolored hybrid mana symbols in its mana cost has a converted mana cost equal to the highest possible cost it could be cast for. Its converted mana cost never changes. Thus, Tower Above has a converted mana cost of 6, even if you spend {G}{G}{G} to cast it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes more than one monocolored hybrid mana symbol, you can choose a different way to pay for each symbol. For example, you can pay for Tower Above by spending {G}{G}{G}, {2}{G}{G}, {4}{G}, or {6}.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect reduces the cost to cast a spell by an amount of generic mana, it applies to a monocolored hybrid spell only if you’ve chosen a method of paying for it that includes generic mana.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'When the creature affected by Tower Above attacks, you can target any creature on the battlefield with the triggered ability. However, if the creature you target can’t block the creature affected by Tower Above (for example, because the attacking creature has flying and the other one doesn’t, or because both creatures are controlled by the same player), the triggered ability does nothing. In that case, the creature you targeted is free to block whichever creature its controller chooses, or block no creatures at all.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A spell or ability whose effect would put a counter on Tatterkite simply doesn’t affect it. The spell or ability isn’t countered. If it would put counters on any other creatures, it continues to do so.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Tatterkite is dealt damage by a creature with wither, that damage has no effect. It’s not prevented; it just doesn’t do anything. Abilities that trigger on damage being dealt will still trigger.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Tatterkite would enter the battlefield with counters on it, it enters the battlefield but doesn’t have those counters. For example, if an effect grants it persist and then it’s destroyed, it returns to the battlefield without a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Tatterkite’s ability prevents any kind of counter from being placed on it, not just -1/-1 counters.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You can’t pay a cost that includes putting a counter on Tatterkite. For example, if Tatterkite is the only creature you control, you can’t cast Scarscale Ritual because you can’t pay the additional cost.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'A token created by a Cemetery Puca that’s copying a Spawnwrithe will be a Spawnwrithe with the Cemetery Puca ability.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'As the token is created, it checks the printed values of the Spawnwrithe it’s copying — or, if the Spawnwrithe whose ability triggered was itself a token, the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield — as well as any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won’t copy counters on the Spawnwrithe, nor will it copy other effects that have changed Spawnwrithe’s power, toughness, types, color, or so on. Normally, this means the token will simply be a Spawnwrithe. But if any copy effects have affected that Spawnwrithe, they’re taken into account.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Spawnwrithe’s ability triggers, then Spawnwrithe becomes a copy of another creature before its ability resolves (due to Mirrorweave, perhaps), the token will be a copy of whatever creature the Spawnwrithe is currently a copy of. At the end of the turn, Spawnwrithe will revert back to what it was, but the token will stay as it is.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a copy effect such as Mirrorweave causes some other creature to become a copy of Spawnwrithe, then that creature deals combat damage to a player, the token that’s put onto the battlefield is simply a copy of Spawnwrithe.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'After Scrapbasket’s ability resolves, an effect that changes its colors will overwrite that ability’s effect. For example, casting Cerulean Wisps on it will turn it just blue.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Scrapbasket’s ability won’t stop it from being an artifact. It’ll just be a colorful artifact.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'After the process stops, the total amount of life each player paid this way is calculated. That’s how many tokens each player gets. All the tokens enter the battlefield at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a player chooses to spend life, their life total goes down immediately. This will affect how much life that player can spend the next time the process gets around to them. If a player chooses to pay life three different times during this process, for example, that counts as three separate instances of losing life, not as one.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, each player on a team gets a chance to pay life. The team’s life total is adjusted in between.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'In a game of N players, the process ends when all N players in sequence (starting with you) choose not to pay life. It doesn’t end the first time a player chooses not to pay life. If a player chooses not to pay life but the process continues, that player may pay life the next time the process gets around to them.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The amount of life a player may spend must be equal to or less than that player’s life total; you can’t spend life you haven’t got.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'All players get to see which card you chose at random.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Except for the card that you return to your hand, reordering your graveyard won’t affect anything that’s currently targeting or enchanting a card in your graveyard. Whatever it is will be able to track the card it’s targeting or enchanting as your graveyard is reordered.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you have multiple cards in your graveyard with the same name, and one of them is being targeted by another spell on the stack or enchanted (with Spellweaver Volute, for example), you must differentiate them so you know which one (if any) is chosen at random. In that case, it may be better to use dice to choose a card at random, or temporarily use a proxy card to represent the targeted card.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The easiest way to choose a card at random from your graveyard is to turn your graveyard face down, shuffle it, and pick a card. You’re not normally allowed to reorder your graveyard, but since this card lets you do it anyway, it’s okay to mix the cards up while you’re picking randomly.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'All your lands will have the chosen land type and no other land type.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "Changing a land\'s type doesn\'t change its name or whether it\'s legendary or basic."}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'Lands you control will have the mana ability of the basic land type you choose (for example, Forests can tap to produce green mana) and will lose all other innate abilities they had.\'}]', "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'An effect that changes a permanent’s colors overwrites all its old colors unless it specifically says “in addition to its other colors.” For example, after Cerulean Wisps resolves, the affected creature will just be blue. It doesn’t matter what colors it used to be (even if, for example, it used to be blue and black).'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Changing a permanent’s color won’t change its text. If you turn Wilt-Leaf Liege blue, it will still affect green creatures and white creatures.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Colorless is not a color.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability won’t make an artifact stop being an artifact. It’ll just be a colorful artifact.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You can choose any single color or any combination of more than one color. You can’t choose colorless.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'An effect that changes a permanent’s colors overwrites all its old colors unless it specifically says “in addition to its other colors.” For example, after Cerulean Wisps resolves, the affected creature will just be blue. It doesn’t matter what colors it used to be (even if, for example, it used to be blue and black).'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Changing a permanent’s color won’t change its text. If you turn Wilt-Leaf Liege blue, it will still affect green creatures and white creatures.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Colorless is not a color.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'An object that’s both of the listed colors will cause both abilities to trigger. You can put them on the stack in either order.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'As Wild Swing resolves, there is no time to react between the time a permanent is chosen at random and the time it’s destroyed. If you want to put a regeneration shield on one of those permanents, or sacrifice it for some effect, or anything else, you must do so before Wild Swing resolves (and before you know which one of the permanents will be chosen at random).'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You target three permanents as you cast Wild Swing. You don’t randomly choose which one will be destroyed until Wild Swing resolves. If one of those permanents has become an illegal target by then, you randomly choose between the other two. If two of those permanents have become illegal targets by then, there is no random choice — the remaining permanent is destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'As the end step begins, Sygg’s ability checks whether a player who is currently your opponent, or a player who was your opponent at the time they left the game, has lost 3 or more life over the course of the turn. If so, the ability will trigger. If not, it won’t.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter how the opponent lost life or who caused it, as long as the total loss of life is 3 or more.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Sygg’s ability checks only whether life was lost. It doesn’t care whether life was also gained. For example, if an opponent lost 4 life and gained 6 life during the turn, that player will have a higher life total than they started the turn with — but Sygg’s ability will trigger anyway.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Sygg’s ability checks to see if it triggers at the end of every turn. It doesn’t have to be your turn, and it doesn’t have to be the turn of the opponent that lost life.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Sygg’s ability will trigger even if Sygg wasn’t on the battlefield at the time some or all of the life was lost.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You don’t specify an opponent when the ability triggers. If multiple opponents have lost 3 or more life over the course of the turn, the ability will trigger only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'As the turn ends, the other creatures revert to what they were before. If two Mirrorweaves are cast on the same turn, they’ll both wear off at the same time.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Each other creature copies the printed values of the targeted creature, plus any copy effects that have been applied to that creature. They won’t copy other effects that have changed the targeted creature’s power, toughness, types, color, or so on. They also won’t copy counters on the targeted creature (they’ll each just retain the counters they already have).'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is a token, each other creature copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. Those creatures don’t become tokens.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted creature is itself copying a creature, each other creature will become whatever it’s copying, as modified by that copy effect. For example, if you target a Cemetery Puca that’s copying a Grizzly Bears (a 2/2 creature with no abilities), each other creature will become a Grizzly Bears with the Cemetery Puca ability.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Noncopy effects that have already applied to the other creatures will continue to apply to them. For example, if Giant Growth had given one of them +3/+3 earlier in the turn, then Mirrorweave made it a copy of Grizzly Bears, it will be a 5/5 Grizzly Bears.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This effect can cause each other creature to stop being a creature. For example, if you target an animated Mutavault (a land with an activated ability that turns it into a creature), only the printed wording will be copied — the “becomes a creature” effect won’t. Each other creature will become an unanimated Mutavault.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Cemetery Puca copies the printed values of the creature, plus any copy effects that have been applied to it. It won’t copy other effects that have changed the creature’s power, toughness, types, color, or so on. It also won’t copy counters on the creature (it’ll just retain the counters it already has).'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Cemetery Puca’s ability isn’t targeted. It can copy a creature with shroud or protection.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Cemetery Puca becomes a copy of a token, it copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put it onto the battlefield. It does not become a token.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If multiple creatures are put into their owners’ graveyards at the same time, Cemetery Puca’s ability will trigger once for each of those creatures. You choose the order that those abilities will resolve. It’s possible to pay {1}, have Cemetery Puca become a copy of something, activate an activated ability of that creature, then pay {1} again, for example. It will end up a copy of the last creature card paid for.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This effect has no duration. If you use the ability, Cemetery Puca will remain a copy of the creature until it leaves the battlefield or you use the ability again. If it becomes a copy of a different creature card, the new copy will overwrite the old copy.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Colorless is not a color. You can’t reveal two colorless cards from your hand to activate this ability because those cards don’t share a color with one another.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The two revealed cards stay revealed until the ability resolves. If one of them is played, is discarded, or otherwise leaves your hand, the ability will still resolve as normal.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Counterbore has no effect on cards on the battlefield that have the same name as the targeted spell.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the spell’s controller isn’t the same as its owner (due to Commandeer, for example), it won’t be exiled. The spell is countered and put into its owner’s graveyard. Then the spell’s controller’s graveyard, hand, and library are searched.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted spell can’t be countered (it’s Vexing Shusher, for example), that spell will remain on the stack. Counterbore will continue to resolve. You still get to search for and exile all other cards with that name.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'In most cases, Counterbore will exile the targeted spell. Its first sentence counters the spell, which puts it into its owner’s graveyard. Its second sentence then removes it from the graveyard. However, there are some exceptions to this, as listed below.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The cards you’re searching for must be found if they’re in the graveyard, because that’s a zone everyone can see. Finding those cards in the hand and library is optional, though.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Each card becomes a new object as it changes zones, so this effect will apply to it from scratch in the new zone. Zone-change replacement abilities that care about the new color (like “[color] permanents enter the battlefield tapped”) won’t work because those effects are applied as the card is entering its new zone. Zone-change triggered abilities that care about the new color (like “when a [color] permanent enters the battlefield” or “when you cast a [color] spell”) will work because those effects apply after the card is already in its new zone.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If something affected by Painter’s Servant is normally colorless, it will simply be the new color. It won’t be both the new color and colorless.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The effects of multiple Painter’s Servants are cumulative.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability affects every card in every game zone, all tokens on the battlefield, and all spell copies on the stack, regardless of who controls or owns them.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability doesn’t overwrite any previous colors. Rather, it adds another color.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'While Painter’s Servant is on the battlefield, an effect that changes an object’s colors will overwrite Painter’s Servant’s effect. For example, casting Cerulean Wisps on a creature will turn it blue, regardless of the color chosen for Painter’s Servant.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Each land you control will have the land types Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. They’ll also have the mana ability of each basic land type (for example, Forests can tap to produce {G}). They’ll still have their other subtypes and abilities.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Giving a land extra basic land types doesn’t change its name or whether it’s legendary or basic.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Each of those creatures will get just one new -1/-1 counter, regardless of how many it already has.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Effects that replace an event with gaining life (like Words of Worship’s effect does) will end up replacing the event with nothing.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Effects that would replace gaining life with some other effect won’t be able to do anything because it’s impossible for players to gain life.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a cost includes life gain (like Invigorate’s alternative cost does), that cost can’t be paid.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect says to set your life total to a certain number, and that number is higher than your current life total, that effect will normally cause you to gain life equal to the difference. With Everlasting Torment on the battlefield, that part of the effect won’t do anything. (If the number is lower than your current life total, the effect will work as normal.)'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Spells and abilities that replace or redirect damage aren’t affected by Everlasting Torment’s second ability. They’ll work as normal.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Spells and abilities that would normally cause a player to gain life still resolve, but the life-gain part simply has no effect.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The last ability affects all damage, whether it’s dealt by creatures, other permanents, spells, or cards that aren’t on the battlefield. Wither works everywhere.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The “damage can’t be prevented” statement overrides all forms of preventing damage, including protection abilities. Damage prevention spells and abilities can still be cast and played; they just don’t do anything.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Ember Gale will deal damage only to white and/or blue creatures the targeted player controls at the time it resolves. However, it will prevent all creatures that player controls from blocking that turn, even if those creatures enter the battlefield later.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Even if you don’t plan on exchanging control of any permanents, if you can choose two legal targets when the ability triggers, you must do so. If you can’t, then you don’t choose any targets.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If either one of the targets becomes illegal (because it leaves the battlefield or for any other reason) by the time the ability resolves, the exchange won’t happen. If both targets become illegal, the ability doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You choose two targets such that as a set, all of the targeting conditions are met. That means, for example, that if you control a nonland permanent whose converted mana cost is lower than any of your opponents’ nonland permanents, you can’t choose it as a target. (If you did, you’d be unable to choose a second target.)'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Faerie Macabre’s second ability can be activated only while it’s in your hand. You can do this any time you could cast an instant.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The targeted cards may be in the same graveyard or in different graveyards.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Fate Transfer moves any kind of counters, not just -1/-1 counters.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If either one of the targets becomes illegal (because it leaves the battlefield or for any other reason) by the time Fate Transfer resolves, the counters don’t move. If both targets become illegal, Fate Transfer doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This effect may result in useless counters being placed on a creature. For example, if an age counter is moved from a creature with cumulative upkeep to a creature without cumulative upkeep, it will have no effect on the new creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Demigod of Revenge is countered *before* its triggered ability resolves, the ability will still resolve. It will return that Demigod of Revenge from your graveyard to the battlefield, as well as any others. If you’re casting a spell to counter Demigod of Revenge, it’s important to clarify you’re casting it *after* the triggered ability resolves if you don’t want that Demigod of Revenge to be put onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability will resolve before Demigod of Revenge will.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers when you cast Demigod of Revenge as a spell. It won’t trigger if Demigod of Revenge is put directly onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Dusk Urchins has just 1 toughness when it blocks, it will get a -1/-1 counter and be put into the graveyard. The creature that it blocked remains blocked, however.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The -1/-1 counter is put on Dusk Urchins during the declare attackers or declare blockers step, whichever is appropriate, so it will be smaller by the time combat damage is dealt. (Note that this is different from how the _Shadowmoor_ card Wicker Warcrawler works.)'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Hollowsage becomes untapped during your untap step, the ability will trigger. However, since no player gets priority during the untap step, it waits to be put on the stack until your upkeep starts. At that time, all your “beginning of upkeep” triggers will also trigger. You can put them and Hollowsage’s trigger on the stack in any order.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Inescapable Brute is attacking, the defending player must assign at least one blocker to it during the declare blockers step if that player controls any creatures that could block Inescapable Brute.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If Pili-Pala is already untapped, you can’t activate its {Q} ability. That’s because you can’t pay the “Untap this permanent” cost.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a creature with an {Q} ability hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began, you can’t activate that ability, unless the creature has haste.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Pili-Pala’s ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t use the stack and can’t be responded to.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Using this creature’s ability means you’re untapping it for mana, not tapping it for mana. Mana Reflection won’t cause it to produce extra mana.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If River Kelpie and another permanent are each put onto the battlefield from a graveyard at the same time, River Kelpie’s first ability will trigger twice. (It will see the other permanent entering the battlefield.)'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you cast River Kelpie itself from your graveyard (by using Yawgmoth’s Will, for example), neither ability triggers. The first ability doesn’t trigger because River Kelpie is put onto the stack; the second ability doesn’t trigger because it works only while River Kelpie is already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you cast another artifact, creature, enchantment, or planeswalker spell from a graveyard, only the second ability triggers. That’s because the card is put onto the stack, not onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you play a land card from a graveyard (by using Crucible of Worlds, for example), only the first ability triggers. That’s because the land (which isn’t a spell) is put directly onto the battlefield from the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'River Kelpie doesn’t give you the ability to cast spells from graveyards. Its second ability merely triggers whenever a spell is cast this way (by using Memory Plunder, for example).'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a creature with an {Q} ability hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began, you can’t activate that ability, unless the creature has haste.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If either one of the target creatures becomes an illegal target (because it left the battlefield or for any other reason), the counter doesn’t move. If both targets become illegal, the ability doesn’t resolve.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the permanent is already untapped, you can’t activate its {Q} ability. That’s because you can’t pay the “Untap this permanent” cost.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Leech Bonder’s activated ability can move any kind of counter, not just a -1/-1 counter. It can target any two creatures, whether they have counters on them or not.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This effect may result in a useless counter being placed on a creature. For example, if an age counter is moved from a creature with cumulative upkeep to a creature without cumulative upkeep, it will have no effect on the new creature.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'When you activate an {Q} ability, you untap the creature with that ability as a cost. The untap can’t be responded to. (The actual ability can be responded to, of course.)'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a creature with an {Q} ability hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began, you can’t activate that ability, unless the creature has haste.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the permanent is already untapped, you can’t activate its {Q} ability. That’s because you can’t pay the “Untap this permanent” cost.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you don’t play the exiled card that turn, it remains exiled but you can’t play it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The exiled card is played using the normal timing rules for its card type, as well as any other applicable restrictions such as “Cast [this card] only during combat.” For example, you can’t play the card during an opponent’s turn unless it’s an instant or has flash. Similarly, if the exiled card is a land, you can’t play it if you’ve already played a land that turn. If it’s a nonland card, you’ll have to pay its mana cost. The only thing that’s different is you’re playing it from the Exile zone.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'When you activate an {Q} ability, you untap the creature with that ability as a cost. The untap can’t be responded to. (The actual ability can be responded to, of course.)'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a creature with an {Q} ability hasn’t been under your control since your most recent turn began, you can’t activate that ability, unless the creature has haste.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the permanent is already untapped, you can’t activate its {Q} ability. That’s because you can’t pay the “Untap this permanent” cost.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'When you activate an {Q} ability, you untap the creature with that ability as a cost. The untap can’t be responded to. (The actual ability can be responded to, of course.)'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a creature with wither would deal damage to Swans of Bryn Argoll, that damage is treated just like any other damage. It’s prevented, and the creature’s controller draws cards. Swans of Bryn Argoll doesn’t get any -1/-1 counters.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a spell is causing damage to be dealt, that spell will always identify the source of the damage. In most cases, the source is the spell itself. For example, Burn Trail says “Burn Trail deals 3 damage to any target.”'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an ability is causing damage to be dealt, that ability will always identify the source of the damage. The ability itself is never the source. However, the source of the ability is often the source of the damage. For example, Knollspine Invocation’s ability says “Knollspine Invocation deals X damage to any target.”'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the source of the damage is a permanent, Swans of Bryn Argoll checks who that permanent’s controller is at the time that damage is prevented. If the permanent has left the battlefield by then, its last known information is used. If the source of the damage is a spell, its controller is obvious. If the source of the damage is a card from some other zone (such as a cycled Gempalm Incinerator), Swans of Bryn Argoll checks its owner rather than its controller.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The source of combat damage is the creature that deals it.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If a nontoken creature that gains persist this way is put into a graveyard, that card will be returned to the battlefield with a -1/-1 counter on it. However, because it’s a new object with no relation to its previous existence, the returned creature will not have persist.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If an effect would simultaneously destroy Shield of the Oversoul and a green creature it’s enchanting, only the Shield is destroyed.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is both of the listed colors, it will get both bonuses.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If a green creature enchanted by Shield of the Oversoul is dealt lethal damage, the creature isn’t destroyed, but the damage remains on the creature. If Shield of the Oversoul stops enchanting that creature later in the turn, the creature will lose indestructible and will be destroyed.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If multiple cards would be put into the enchanted player’s graveyard at the same time (due to Millstone, for example), they are instead all revealed and put on the bottom of the enchanted player’s library at the same time. That player chooses what order to put them in. The order is not revealed to the other players.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Wheel of Sun and Moon won’t affect tokens that are put into the graveyard from the battlefield or copies of spells that resolve or are countered. They’re not cards, so they’ll go to the graveyard as normal, then cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Wheel of Sun and Moon’s replacement effect will apply to cards that would be put into the enchanted player’s graveyard from any game zone. This includes from the battlefield (if a nontoken permanent is destroyed or would otherwise be put into the graveyard), from the stack (if a spell is countered, or if an instant or sorcery spell resolves), from the player’s hand or library, and so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the ability is activated after the current turn’s End step has begun, the creature won’t be sacrificed until the next turn’s End step.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you put a creature onto the battlefield and a different player takes control of it before the end of the turn, you can’t sacrifice it at end of turn. It will remain on the battlefield. It will have haste as long as it’s on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is both of the listed colors, it will get both bonuses.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The two abilities trigger when the enchanted creature deals damage to an opponent of the creature’s controller, not when it deals damage to an opponent of the Helm’s controller. They trigger from any damage, not just combat damage.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'With regards to the two triggered abilities that Helm of the Ghastlord grants to the enchanted creature, the point when damage is actually dealt is the only time it matters what color the creature is. If the creature is blue or black at that time, the appropriate ability or abilities will trigger. They’ll resolve even if the creature changes color or loses its Aura.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the enchanted creature is both of the listed colors, it will get both bonuses.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted opponent becomes an illegal target, the entire spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t get a token.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The parts of the spell happen in order. When determining how many black creatures and how many red creatures you control, keep in mind that you just put a creature onto the battlefield that’s black and red.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If the targeted spell can’t be countered, that spell will remain on the stack. Put Away will continue to resolve. If you targeted a card in your graveyard, you still get to shuffle it into your library.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you choose to target a card in your graveyard, Put Away will have two targets. If either one of the targets becomes illegal, Put Away will continue to resolve and affect the other target.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You must choose all the targets at the time you cast Put Away. You can’t use it to counter your own spell and then shuffle that card into your library because at the time you choose targets, the spell isn’t in your graveyard yet.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If there are no other creatures on the battlefield when Cultbrand Cinder enters the battlefield, it must target itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If two Godheads of Awe are on the battlefield, they’ll each make the other one 1/1.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This doesn’t cause creatures to lose their abilities.'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'Godhead of Awe’s ability overwrites other effects that set a creature’s power and toughness to specific values only if those effects existed before the Godhead entered the battlefield. It will not overwrite effects that modify power or toughness (whether from a static ability, counters, or a resolved spell or ability), nor will it overwrite effects that set power and toughness which come into existence after the Godhead enters the battlefield. Effects that switch the creature’s power and toughness are always applied after any other power or toughness changing effects, including that of the Godhead.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you choose to target a creature spell, Repel Intruders has a target. If that target becomes illegal by the time Repel Intruders resolves, the entire spell won’t resolve. You won’t get any tokens.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You choose whether or not to target a creature spell before you decide whether or not to spend {U} on Repel Intruders. You may target a creature spell and then not spend {U} to cast Repel Intruders; if you do, Repel Intruders simply won’t affect that creature spell. Similarly, if you don’t target a creature spell but then you spend {U} to cast Repel Intruders, that part of Repel Intruders has no effect.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If this spell is copied, the copy will not have had any colors of mana paid for it, no matter what colors were spent on the original spell.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'This spell cares about what mana was spent to pay its total cost, not just what mana was spent to pay the hybrid mana symbol in its cost.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'This spell checks on resolution to see if any mana of the appropriate colors were spent to pay its cost. It doesn’t matter how much mana of that color was spent; the effect isn’t multiplied.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you control a Lurebound Scarecrow but no color was chosen for it (perhaps because your Cemetery Puca turned into a Lurebound Scarecrow), the trigger condition will have an undefined value in it. It’ll never trigger, so you won’t have to sacrifice the Scarecrow.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you control no Mountains as you cast Jaws of Stone, the number of targets must be zero.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The amount of damage is locked in as you cast Jaws of Stone. It won’t change, even if the number of Mountains you control changes.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You divide the damage among the targets as you cast Jaws of Stone. Each target must be assigned at least 1 damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you don’t control any creatures, you can’t cast Scarscale Ritual.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you have two on the battlefield, they’ll each grant the other one shroud.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you spent both {G} and {W} to cast Dawnglow Infusion, you’ll gain (X + X) life. An ability that triggers whenever you gain life will trigger just once.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Whether you choose to spend both {G} and {W} to cast Dawnglow Infusion has no bearing on the value of X. For example, say you decide that X is 4 and you’ll spend {G} on {G/W}. If you end up spending {W}{W}{R}{R}{G} to pay the cost, X is still 4 and you’ve spent both {G} and {W}. You’ll gain a total of 8 life.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If this spell is copied, the copy will not have had any colors of mana paid for it, no matter what colors were spent on the original spell.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'This spell cares about what mana was spent to pay its total cost, not just what mana was spent to pay the hybrid mana symbol in its cost.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'This spell checks on resolution to see if any mana of the appropriate colors were spent to pay its cost. It doesn’t matter how much mana of that color was spent; the effect isn’t multiplied.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you target a creature with 1 toughness, Puncture Bolt deals 1 damage to it, then puts a -1/-1 counter on it, which reduces it to 0 toughness. The creature will be put into its owner’s graveyard as a result of having 0 toughness. Regeneration can’t save it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you target a creature with 2 toughness, Puncture Bolt deals 1 damage to it, then puts a -1/-1 counter on it, which reduces it to 1 toughness. The creature will be destroyed as a result of lethal damage. Regeneration could save it.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Puncture Bolt will resolve fully (and give the creature a -1/-1 counter) even if the 1 damage would be enough to destroy it. (This would matter if a 3/3 creature with persist had already been dealt 2 damage, for example.)'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'If you use conspire to copy Traitor’s Roar, but you don’t change its target, the copy will resolve just fine but the original doesn’t resolve. That’s because the copy will resolve first, and as part of its resolution, it will tap the targeted creature. Then, when the original Traitor’s Roar tries to resolve, it will have an illegal target (since it must target an untapped creature).'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter which library has twenty or fewer cards in it, and you don’t have to specify a library. If multiple libraries have twenty or fewer cards in them, Isleback Spawn will still get its bonus only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Murderous Redcap’s power is checked at the time the ability resolves. If it’s left the battlefield by then, its last known information is used.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Regenerating a planeswalker will prevent it from being destroyed as a result of a “destroy” effect (like the one from Reaper King). However, it won’t prevent that planeswalker from being put into its owner’s graveyard when its loyalty becomes 0.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Reknit can regenerate an artifact, creature, enchantment, land, or planeswalker. If you regenerate a noncreature permanent, the next time that permanent would be destroyed that turn, instead tap it. If that permanent had any damage on it (because it had been a creature earlier in the turn), that damage is removed.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Sinking Feeling grants the untap ability to the creature it’s enchanting. Only the creature’s controller can activate that ability, not Sinking Feeling’s controller.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Spiteful Visions’s second ability triggers any time any player draws a card, not just when a player draws a card as a result of its first ability.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'The triggered ability is put onto the stack after you have already drawn your card for the turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The -1/-1 counter is put on Wicker Warcrawler at end of combat, after combat damage has already been dealt. (Note that this is different from how Dusk Urchins works.)'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The -1/-1 counters that are put on the enchanted creature are independent of Torture. If Torture leaves the battlefield or is moved to another creature, the counters will stay put.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The abilities are separate and cumulative. If another creature you control is both of the listed colors, it will get a total of +2/+2.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The first ability checks whether you have no cards in hand both when it triggers and when it resolves. If you have any cards in your hand at the beginning of your upkeep, it won’t trigger at all. If you have any cards in your hand when the ability resolves, it does nothing.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The second ability behaves the same way, except that it’s checking your opponent instead of you.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The first ability essentially means that Mossbridge Troll always has a regeneration shield. It retains that shield even if it’s used.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The total power of the creatures you tap is checked only when you pay the cost. It doesn’t matter if their power decreases, or if any of them have left the battlefield, by the time the ability resolves. Note that you may tap a Mossbridge Troll to help pay the cost of a different Mossbridge Troll’s ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The last ability works only if Prison Term is already on the battlefield. You may move it from the creature it’s currently enchanting onto the new creature.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'Activated abilities contain a colon. They’re generally written “[Cost]: [Effect].” Some keywords are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The prevention effect applies even after the creature leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The second ability can target any creature except the Grim Poppet whose ability is being activated. It can target a different Grim Poppet. It can be activated multiple times targeting the same creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': \'The tokens enter the battlefield under your control.\'}, {\'date\': \'2008-05-01\', \'text\': "You target the opponent when you activate Oona\'s ability. You don\'t choose the color until the ability resolves."}]', "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'The triggered ability is mandatory. If you’re the only player who controls any creatures when it triggers, you must target one of them.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability is mandatory. If you’re the only player who controls any creatures when this ability triggers, you must target one of them.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'When Blowfly Infestation’s ability resolves, it will put a single -1/-1 counter on the targeted creature. It doesn’t matter how many -1/-1 counters were on the creature that went to a graveyard as long as it had at least one on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers both when a -1/-1 counter is put on a creature on the battlefield and when a creature enters the battlefield with a -1/-1 counter on it. This includes when a creature returns to the battlefield as a result of persist.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers once for each -1/-1 counter. For example, if Leech Bonder (a creature that enters the battlefield with two -1/-1 counters on it) entered the battlefield, Flourishing Defenses’s ability would trigger twice.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability triggers from any damage, not just combat damage, that Deus of Calamity deals to an opponent in increments of 6 or more.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This ability will trigger when Deus of Calamity deals 6 damage to an opponent at one time. It won’t keep track of the accumulated damage that it deals at different times.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This can remove any kind of counter, not just a -1/-1 counter.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You may target a permanent that doesn’t have a counter on it.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This checks your opponents’ creatures for any kind of counters, not just -1/-1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This has no effect on those permanents other than letting them interact with things that care about enchantments.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'This is a static ability. Your creatures will have lifelink from the moment they’re declared as attackers until the moment the combat phase ends, they’re removed from combat, or Windbrisk Raptor leaves the battlefield, whichever comes first.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'When Glamer Spinners enters the battlefield, you target only one permanent: the one that will be losing its Auras. You don’t choose the permanent that will be receiving the Auras until the ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'When the ability resolves, you choose the permanent that will be receiving the Auras. It can’t be the targeted permanent, it must have the same controller as the targeted permanent, and it must be able to be enchanted by all the Auras attached to the targeted permanent. If you can’t choose a permanent that meets all those criteria, the Auras won’t move.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You may target a permanent that has no Auras enchanting it.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Witherscale Wurm’s first ability does *not* give Witherscale Wurm wither.'}, {'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'Witherscale Wurm’s second ability triggers when it deals any damage to an opponent, not just combat damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You may target a creature that doesn’t have flying.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You must target three different creatures. If you can’t, you can’t cast Incremental Blight.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You put the -1/-1 counter on Barrenton Medic as a cost. That means it happens when you activate the ability, not when it resolves. If paying the cost causes the creature to have 0 toughness, it’s put into the graveyard before you can untap it and before you can even pay the cost again.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-05-01', 'text': 'You put the -1/-1 counter on Cinderhaze Wretch as a cost. That means it happens when you activate the ability, not when it resolves. If paying the cost causes the creature to have 0 toughness, it’s put into the graveyard before you can untap it and before you can even pay the cost again.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'The second ability is a mana ability. It doesn’t target a player and it doesn’t use the stack. If the player who adds {G}{G}{G} to their mana pool can’t spend all of it before the phase ends, the remaining mana will leave their mana pool at the end of the current step (or phase).'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This ability counts the number of Plains controlled by Armored Ascension’s controller, not the enchanted creature’s controller (in case they’re different players).'}, {'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'This bonus is not fixed; it changes as the number of Plains you control changes.'}, {'date': '2010-08-15', 'text': 'The ability cares about lands with the land type Plains, not necessarily lands named Plains.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'Players can only respond once this spell has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2013-04-15', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast this spell; you cannot cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you cannot sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner\'s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won\'t trigger and the card won\'t return to the battlefield. That\'s because persist checks the creature\'s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they\'ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can\'t return to the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player\'s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player\'s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time."}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': \'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-06-07\', \'text\': "When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it\'s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence."}]', "[{'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist stops being a creature, persist will still work.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a creature with persist that has +1/+1 counters on it receives enough -1/-1 counters to cause it to be destroyed by lethal damage or put into its owner’s graveyard for having 0 or less toughness, persist won’t trigger and the card won’t return to the battlefield. That’s because persist checks the creature’s existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a permanent has multiple instances of persist, they’ll each trigger separately, but the redundant instances will have no effect. If one instance returns the card to the battlefield, the next to resolve will do nothing.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If a token with no -1/-1 counters on it has persist, the ability will trigger when the token is put into the graveyard. However, the token will cease to exist and can’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'If multiple creatures with persist are put into the graveyard at the same time (due to combat damage or a spell that destroys all creatures, for example), the active player (the player whose turn it is) puts all of their persist triggers on the stack in any order, then each other player in turn order does the same. The last trigger put on the stack is the first one that resolves. That means that in a two-player game, the nonactive player’s persist creatures will return to the battlefield first, then the active player’s persist creatures do the same. The creatures return to the battlefield one at a time.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'The persist ability triggers when the permanent is put into a graveyard. Its last known information (that is, how the creature last existed on the battlefield) is used to determine whether it had a -1/-1 counter on it.'}, {'date': '2013-06-07', 'text': 'When a permanent with persist returns to the battlefield, it’s a new object with no memory of or connection to its previous existence.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'Howl of the Night Pack counts any land you control with the subtype Forest, not just ones named Forest.'}, {'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'The number of Wolves you put onto the battlefield is based on the number of Forests you control when Howl of the Night Pack resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'If an artifact or enchantment remains on the battlefield because it was regenerated or has indestructible, you won’t gain life for it.'}]", "[{'date': '2013-07-01', 'text': 'You target the creature that will be sacrificed when you cast Mercy Killing, then its controller (who may or may not be you) sacrifices it when Mercy Killing resolves. Because this is a sacrifice, neither regeneration nor indestructibile will save the creature.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "If the creature is an illegal target when Last Breath tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. Its controller won\'t gain 4 life."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Smash to Smithereens targets only the artifact, not any player. If that artifact becomes an illegal target by the time Smash to Smithereens tries to resolve, Smash to Smithereens won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. No damage will be dealt.'}]", "[{'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'If this spell is copied, the copy will not have had any colors of mana paid for it, no matter what colors were spent on the original spell.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'This spell cares about what mana was spent to pay its total cost, not just what mana was spent to pay the hybrid mana symbol in its cost.'}, {'date': '2016-06-08', 'text': 'This spell checks on resolution to see if any mana of the appropriate colors were spent to pay its cost. It doesn’t matter how much mana of that color was spent; the effect isn’t multiplied.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If a spell gains a second instance of conspire from Wort’s ability, you may choose to pay for one, both, or none of those abilities. Each conspire ability triggers only if you tap two creatures specifically for that ability.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the spell has damage divided as it was cast (like Fiery Justice does), the division can’t be changed (although the targets receiving that damage still can).'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast (like Bonfire of the Damned does), the copy will have the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode. A different mode can’t be chosen.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'If you’re casting a spell for its flashback cost, you can’t pay another alternative cost (such as an overload cost or a Trap’s alternative cost) instead. You may pay additional costs, such as conspire.'}, {'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'Some spells instruct you to sacrifice a creature as an additional cost to cast that spell. If you sacrifice Wort to pay that cost, that spell won’t have conspire at the moment it becomes cast, so conspire won’t trigger, even if you tapped two creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-03-14', 'text': 'The delayed triggered ability that exiles the token isn’t a characteristic of the token. If an effect such as populate copies the token, the new token won’t be exiled.'}]", "[{'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'A “cost that contains {X}” may be a spell’s total cost, an activated ability’s cost, a suspend cost, or a cost you’re asked to pay as part of the resolution of a spell or ability (such as Condescend). A spell’s total cost includes either its mana cost (printed in the upper right corner) or its alternative cost (such as flashback), as well as any additional costs (such as kicker). If it’s something you can spend mana on, it’s a cost. If that cost includes the {X} symbol in it, you can spend mana generated by Rosheen on that cost.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You can spend mana generated by Rosheen on a cost that includes {X} even if you’ve chosen an X of 0, or if the card specifies that you can spend only colored mana on X. (You’ll have to spend Rosheen’s mana on a different part of that cost, of course.)'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You can spend mana generated by Rosheen on any part of a cost that contains {X}. You’re not limited to spending it only on the {X} part.'}, {'date': '2017-11-17', 'text': 'You don’t have to spend all four mana on the same cost.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "If you can\'t put -1/-1 counters on Devoted Druid (due to an effect such as that of Solemnity), you can\'t activate its second ability. If you can put counters on it, but that is modified by an effect (such as that of Vizier of Remedies), you can activate the ability even if paying the cost causes no counters to be put on Devoted Druid."}, {\'date\': \'2018-12-07\', \'text\': "You put the -1/-1 counter on Devoted Druid as a cost to activate its ability, not when it resolves. If paying the cost causes Devoted Druid to have 0 toughness, it\'s put into your graveyard before you can untap it and before you can even pay the cost again."}]', "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'A land card that produces white mana, even a Plains, normally has no color.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Once you activate Mistveil Plains’s last ability, it doesn’t matter if you lose control of some of your white permanents.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-12-07', 'text': 'Once the exiled creature returns, it’s considered a new object with no relation to the object that it was. Auras attached to the exiled creature will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Equipment attached to the exiled creature will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled creature will cease to exist.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In the Commander variant, the color identities of cards are determined as the game begins. Changing the colors of a player’s commander doesn’t affect its color identity or the cards that can be legally included in the deck.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The target creature has only the colors Scuttlemutt gives it—Scuttlemutt’s ability overwrites any previous colors the creature had.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'You must choose one or more of the five colors of Magic while resolving Scuttlemutt’s last ability. You can’t choose “artifact,” “colorless,” or “chartreuse.”'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Runed Halo can\'t protect you from tokens unless those tokens have the same name as the card name you choose."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Some cards can have alternative names, such as split cards, adventurer cards, double-faced cards, and so on. You may choose one of the two names the card can have; Runed Halo won\'t protect you from the other name."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "A spell or ability that counters spells can still target spells that can\'t be countered. When that spell or ability resolves, the uncounterable spell won\'t be countered, but any additional effects of the countering spell or ability will still happen."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Cragganwick Cremator deals damage equal to the discarded creature card\'s power as it exists in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If the target player or planeswalker is an illegal target by the time the ability tries to resolve, the ability won\'t resolve. You won\'t discard a card."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If you have no cards in hand when Cragganwick Cremator\'s ability resolves, you don\'t discard anything."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You choose the target player or planeswalker when the ability is put onto the stack. You won\'t know how much damage will be dealt until the ability resolves."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If Wound Reflection\'s ability resolves, then an opponent loses life later in the same turn, that life loss is never counted by Wound Reflection."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Multiple Wound Reflections each trigger separately. For example, if an opponent lost 1 life, the first one\'s triggered ability to resolve causes them to lose another 1 life. Since they\'ve now lost 2 life, the next triggered ability causes them to lose 2 life, and the next 4, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "When Wound Reflection\'s ability resolves, it checks how much life each opponent lost over the course of the turn, then it causes that opponent to lose that much life. It doesn\'t matter how the opponent lost life or who caused it. It also doesn\'t matter if Wound Reflection wasn\'t on the battlefield at the time some or all of the life was lost."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Wound Reflection\'s ability checks only whether life was lost. It doesn\'t care whether life was also gained. For example, if an opponent lost 4 life and gained 6 life during the turn, that player will have a higher life total than they started the turn with but Wound Reflection\'s ability will still cause that player to lose 4 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a creature loses double strike after assigning damage in the first strike combat damage step (due to Rage Reflection leaving the battlefield, for example), that creature won\'t assign damage in the normal combat damage step."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If a spell or ability causes you to draw multiple cards, Thought Reflection\'s effect doubles each card draw. For example, if you cast Harmonize (“Draw three cards”), you\'ll draw six cards."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If two or more replacement effects would apply to a card-drawing event, the player who\'s drawing the card chooses what order to apply them."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Thought Reflections are cumulative. For example, if you have two Thought Reflections on the battlefield, you\'ll draw four times the original number of cards. If you have three, you\'ll draw eight times the number of cards, and so on."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If an ability triggers “whenever you tap” something for mana and produces mana, that triggered mana ability won\'t be affected by Mana Reflection."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "Mana Reflection doesn\'t produce any mana itself. Rather, it causes permanents you tap for mana to produce more mana. If the mana ability of that permanent puts any restrictions or riders on the mana it produces, that will apply to all the mana it produces this way."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Mana Reflections are cumulative. For example, if you have two Mana Reflections on the battlefield, you\'ll get four times the original amount and type of mana. If you have three, you\'ll get eight times the mana, and so on."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "You\'re “tapping a permanent for mana” only if you\'re activating a mana ability of that permanent that includes the {T} symbol in its cost. A mana ability produces mana as part of its effect."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "If an effect would set your life total to a specific number that\'s higher than your current life total, that effect would cause you to gain life equal to the difference. Boon Reflection will then double the amount of life that effect would cause you to gain. For example, if you have 3 life and an effect says that your life total “becomes 10,” your life total will actually become 17."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, only Boon Reflection\'s controller is affected by it. If that player\'s teammate gains life, Boon Reflection will have no effect, even when that life gain is applied to the shared team life total."}, {\'date\': \'2020-08-07\', \'text\': "The effects of multiple Boon Reflections are cumulative. For example, if you control two Boon Reflections, you\'ll gain four times the original amount of life. If you control three Boon Reflections, you\'ll gain eight times the original amount, and so on."}]', "[{'date': '2020-08-07', 'text': 'You choose which color or colors of mana to add to your mana pool before you draw a card.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Allvater des Unglücks\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden\\nImmer wenn der Allvater des Unglücks einem Gegner 6 oder mehr Schadenspunkte zufügt, zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl, das dieser Spieler kontrolliert.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'„Seiner Haut kann man die Zeitalter ansehen, die lange vergangenen Träume, die man am besten begraben lässt." —Die Parabeln der Seherin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174681&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e4b5ee6-6fe9-4398-b0b1-1069c1c4d0a2\', \'multiverseId\': 174681}, \'multiverseid\': 174681}, {\'name\': \'Deus de la calamidad\', \'text\': \'Arrolla.\\nSiempre que el Deus de la calamidad haga 6 o más puntos de daño a un oponente, destruye la tierra objetivo que controla ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu avatar\', \'flavor\': \'"Él lleva las marcas de años en su piel, recuerdos de sueños muertos que sería mejor dejar enterrados." —Las parábolas de la vidente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34b3fc2a-3eb5-411d-a080-505be9cfe111\', \'multiverseId\': 172875}, \'multiverseid\': 172875}, {\'name\': \'Deus de la Calamité\', \'text\': \'Piétinement\\nÀ chaque fois que le Deus de la Calamité inflige au moins 6 blessures à un adversaire, détruisez le terrain ciblé que ce joueur contrôle.\', \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et avatar\', \'flavor\': "« Il porte les marques de l\'âge sur sa peau, les souvenirs de rêves disparus depuis longtemps et qu\'il vaut mieux garder ensevelis. » —Les paraboles de l\'Oracle", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173477&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10dc7064-0401-419a-9e40-ec717482ff30\', \'multiverseId\': 173477}, \'multiverseid\': 173477}, {\'name\': \'Dio delle Calamità\', \'text\': \'Travolgere\\nOgniqualvolta il Dio delle Calamità infligge 6 o più danni a un avversario, distruggi una terra bersaglio controllata da quel giocatore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'"Mostra i segni dell\\\'età sulla sua pelle, ricordi di sogni da tempo morti e che è meglio lasciare sepolti." —Le Parabole della Veggente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173778&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dbfc7e6-18dd-4e6d-b827-bdb23d732036\', \'multiverseId\': 173778}, \'multiverseid\': 173778}, {\'name\': \'災難の大神\', \'text\': \'トランプル\\n災難の大神がいずれかの対戦相手に６点以上のダメージを与えるたび、そのプレイヤーがコントロールする土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・アバター\', \'flavor\': \'「彼は肌に、死して永く忘れ去った方が望ましい歳月の印を帯びている。」 ――「予見者の寓話」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87977dea-eab0-4e5f-95a5-cc1b070de4f2\', \'multiverseId\': 174079}, \'multiverseid\': 174079}, {\'name\': \'Deus da Calamidade\', \'text\': \'Atropelar\\nToda vez que Deus da Calamidade causar 6 ou mais pontos de dano a um oponente, destrua o terreno alvo que aquele jogador controla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Avatar\', \'flavor\': \'"Ele tem as marcas dos anos na pele, memórias de sonhos mortos há tempos e que é melhor que continuem enterrados." — Parábolas da Vidente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0af1a96-f396-474e-9ff7-ad5b334d06d5\', \'multiverseId\': 172273}, \'multiverseid\': 172273}, {\'name\': \'Божество Бедствий\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар\\nКаждый раз, когда Божество Бедствий наносит 6 или более повреждений оппоненту, уничтожьте целевую землю под контролем того игрока.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух Аватара\', \'flavor\': \'«Его тело покрыто отпечатками веков, воспоминаниями о давно погребенных мечтах, которые лучше не воскрешать». — Притчи провидицы\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172574&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9cf2bc8-93bd-48e4-86bb-eade88c57fe1\', \'multiverseId\': 172574}, \'multiverseid\': 172574}, {\'name\': \'苦难神明\', \'text\': \'践踏\\n每当苦难神明向对手造成6点或更多伤害时，消灭目标由该牌手操控的地。\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪／圣者\', \'flavor\': \'「他身上遍布岁月痕迹，这些破灭梦想的回忆都不宜想起。」 ～《预言师寓言》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173176&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fe3efe4-6eff-4aff-9293-63fc904db330\', \'multiverseId\': 173176}, \'multiverseid\': 173176}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alte Schauderborke\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Baumhirte, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Hüte dich vor redenden Bäumen. Jedes ihrer Worte ist eine Bedrohung. Und siehe dich vor, wenn sie nur schwanken und ächzen. Auch sie bedrohen uns, nur in einer anderen Sprache." —Das Buch der anderen Völker\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174709&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d35e386-409f-4d20-b2fe-fbbdf05542db\', \'multiverseId\': 174709}, \'multiverseid\': 174709}, {\'name\': \'Cortezapálida anciano\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero pueblo-arbóreo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ten cuidado con los árboles que hablan. Sus palabras son amenazas. Y cuídate también de los que crujen y se balancean. También esos nos amenazan, pero en otro idioma." —El Libro de Otros Pueblos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172903&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af9bf874-b648-46e5-a43b-028e1d63d9ea\', \'multiverseId\': 172903}, \'multiverseid\': 172903}, {\'name\': \'Vieux pâlécorce\', \'type\': \'Créature : sylvin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Prenez garde aux arbres qui parlent. Leurs paroles sont des menaces. Et méfiez-vous encore plus de ceux qui s\'agitent et qui grincent. Eux aussi nous menacent, mais dans une langue qui nous est étrangère. » —Le livre des Autres", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173505&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b17a4a7c-7368-4d35-bf49-56a39ee22918\', \'multiverseId\': 173505}, \'multiverseid\': 173505}, {\'name\': \'Anziano dalla Bianca Corteccia\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Silvantropo\', \'flavor\': \'"Presta attenzione agli alberi che parlano. Le loro parole sono minacce. Attento anche a quelli che dondolano e scricchiolano. Anche loro ci minacciano, ma in un\\\'altra lingua." —Il Tomo delle Altre Genti\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173806&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c59c504e-aa21-4f61-b0a0-d537b53da65b\', \'multiverseId\': 173806}, \'multiverseid\': 173806}, {\'name\': \'年老いた恐樹皮\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ツリーフォーク・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「言葉を話す樹を恐れよ。 その言葉は脅威である。 揺らぎきしめく者を気に留めよ。 彼らも脅威であるが、その言葉は異国の物である。」 ――「他族の書」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9b5944a-2e04-49db-8e29-dea448102f3d\', \'multiverseId\': 174107}, \'multiverseid\': 174107}, {\'name\': \'Tronco-Pálido Ancião\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ent Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Tome cuidado com as árvores que falam. Suas palavras são ameaças. E atenção com as que balançam e rangem. Elas também nos ameaçam, mas numa língua estrangeira." — O Livro dos Outros Povos\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172301&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d48bbeb0-da58-4216-8bed-625c26fcb13c\', \'multiverseId\': 172301}, \'multiverseid\': 172301}, {\'name\': \'Белокорый Старец\', \'type\': \'Существо — Лесовик Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Опасайся говорящих деревьев. В их словах угроза. И осторожнее с теми, которые раскачиваются и скрипят. Они тоже нам угрожают, но на чужом языке». —Кискенская книга о других народах\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172602&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a581dab-127c-45c3-a266-87a93355926b\', \'multiverseId\': 172602}, \'multiverseid\': 172602}, {\'name\': \'老白皮木\', \'type\': \'生物～树妖／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「小心会讲话的树； 他们的话语隐藏着威胁。 也要小心那些歪斜作响的； 他们同样是威胁，只是用词我们听不懂。」 ～《他族通论》\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173204&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'96cfc07e-e56c-4b0c-990d-e4913e1b7dc3\', \'multiverseId\': 173204}, \'multiverseid\': 173204}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aphotischer Hauch\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl wird bis zum Ende des Zuges schwarz und verursacht Furcht.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Merrow lauern in den verschlammten Sümpfen entlang des Wanderessigs und suhlen sich in bösen Gedanken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174532&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'37626ceb-1775-44f9-a8bb-e52c19c4bf8f\', \'multiverseId\': 174532}, \'multiverseid\': 174532}, {\'name\': \'Centellas afóticas\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo es negra y gana la habilidad de inspirar temor hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Los merrows acechan las ciénagas alrededor del Lágrimaerrante con sus pensamientos impregnados de maldad.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7359d149-4b39-43f3-9a38-ff3391131e2f\', \'multiverseId\': 172726}, \'multiverseid\': 172726}, {\'name\': \'Feux aphotiques\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée devient noire et acquiert la peur jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'Les suires aux pensées souillées par le mal hantent les marais vaseux qui entourent la Bruinerrance.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173328&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb1f77c3-527c-464f-9632-ac58ff9d14bb\', \'multiverseId\': 173328}, \'multiverseid\': 173328}, {\'name\': \'Fuochi Fatui Oscuri\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio diventa nera e ha paura fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'I merrow si rintanano nelle paludi melmose attorno a Brina Errante, macchiando i loro pensieri originari con il male.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173629&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cc890c8-b326-44fc-8a69-f23fa6f629ee\', \'multiverseId\': 173629}, \'multiverseid\': 173629}, {\'name\': \'たなびく暗闇\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで黒になるとともに畏怖を得る。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ワンダーブラインの周りのぬめる泥沼の中、心まで邪悪に染まったメロウが徘徊している。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07c29a5e-fd8c-43e7-a71a-7ec2b9dbf460\', \'multiverseId\': 173930}, \'multiverseid\': 173930}, {\'name\': \'Fogos-Fátuos Afóticos\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo torna-se preta e ganha amedrontar até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Os sirenídeos espreitam nos brejos lamacentos de Salmorerrante, ruminando pensamentos maléficos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b54e4f55-3a3a-4761-a0f4-97a7d8bc1598\', \'multiverseId\': 172124}, \'multiverseid\': 172124}, {\'name\': \'Огоньки Вечной Темноты\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо становится черным и получает Страх до конца хода.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Мерроу прячутся в илистых болотах по берегам Уондербрайна, где все пропитано злом даже их мысли.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172425&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae59ae54-f22c-4d29-9c87-65501f3a9f0e\', \'multiverseId\': 172425}, \'multiverseid\': 172425}, {\'name\': \'昏暗鬼火\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物成为黑色且具有恐惧异能。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'美洛潜行于漫涩河畔淤泥遍布的沼泽，思想完全被邪恶污染。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d19b9ac-3f2f-400d-a988-32d494b8b10a\', \'multiverseId\': 173027}, \'multiverseid\': 173027}]', '[{\'name\': \'Apotheker-Novizin\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn ein Spieler einen weißen Zauberspruch spielt, kannst du {1} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kithkin, Kleriker\', \'flavor\': \'Kithkin hüten ihr Wissen über Heilmittel und Verbände eifersüchtig, damit keine Bedrohung von außen von ihren Künsten profitieren kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174478&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ae19042-c50d-4385-b90e-6d37c9c5047f\', \'multiverseId\': 174478}, \'multiverseid\': 174478}, {\'name\': \'Iniciada boticaria\', \'text\': \'Siempre que un jugador juegue un hechizo blanco, puedes pagar {1}. Si lo haces, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Clérigo kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'Los kithkin atesoran celosamente su conocimiento de cataplasmas y remedios, para que ninguna amenaza exterior pueda beneficiarse con su sabiduría.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c808a558-d81f-493b-8f43-c01a70b5daf3\', \'multiverseId\': 172672}, \'multiverseid\': 172672}, {\'name\': \'Adepte apothicaire\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'un joueur joue un sort blanc, vous pouvez payer {1}. Si vous faites ainsi, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : sangami et clerc\', \'flavor\': "Les sangamis gardent jalousement leur connaissance des remèdes et cataplasmes pour éviter qu\'elle ne tombe entre les mains de l\'ennemi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173274&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'901840ae-21d2-47d5-8552-ecc3b4a707d7\', \'multiverseId\': 173274}, \'multiverseid\': 173274}, {\'name\': \'Iniziata Farmacista\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta un giocatore gioca una magia bianca, puoi pagare {1}. Se lo fai, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Chierico Kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'I kithkin custodiscono gelosamente la loro conoscenza di rimedi e medicamenti, in modo che nessuna minaccia esterna possa beneficiare della loro saggezza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61245d20-b509-4045-a1d0-f5b0f87a91ea\', \'multiverseId\': 173575}, \'multiverseid\': 173575}, {\'name\': \'薬剤師の信徒\', \'text\': \'いずれかのプレイヤーが白の呪文をプレイするたび、あなたは{1}を支払ってもよい。 そうした場合、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キスキン・クレリック\', \'flavor\': \'キスキンは懸命に彼らの湿布や薬の知識を抱え込んでいる。そうすれば、外部からの脅威は彼らの知恵から何も得ることはできないだろうから。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81a464df-5b92-4c71-b364-058dd1cd842f\', \'multiverseId\': 173876}, \'multiverseid\': 173876}, {\'name\': \'Iniciado Boticário\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um jogador joga uma mágica branca, você pode pagar {1}. Se fizer isso, você ganhará 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kithkin Clérigo\', \'flavor\': \'O zelo dos kithkin faz com que escondam seu conhecimento de emplastros e remédios para que nenhuma ameaça externa possa se beneficiar de sua sabedoria.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172070&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31a7f733-18a0-404d-a4c0-5661431a9c6f\', \'multiverseId\': 172070}, \'multiverseid\': 172070}, {\'name\': \'Искусный Аптекарь\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда игрок разыгрывает белое заклинание, вы можете заплатить {1}. Если вы это делаете, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кискен Священник\', \'flavor\': \'Кискены ревностно хранят свое знание целебных припарок и снадобий, чтобы ни один враг извне не воспользовался их мудростью.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74872226-5d82-4310-88a8-1d0b5eb3dae7\', \'multiverseId\': 172371}, \'multiverseid\': 172371}, {\'name\': \'药剂学徒\', \'text\': \'每当任一牌手使用白色咒语时，你可以支付{1}。 若你如此作，则你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物～洁英／僧侣\', \'flavor\': \'洁英谨慎地让该族的草药与治疗知识不外流，让外界威胁没办法从他们的智慧中获益。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9241c10b-5d48-4171-9e1c-105dd9936c34\', \'multiverseId\': 172973}, \'multiverseid\': 172973}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aschenmoorgauner\', \'text\': \'Der Aschenmoorgauner kann nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Nachdem seine Hände abgefallen waren und nur noch spitze Enden hervorragten, beschloss er, dass sein einziges Lebensziel ab jetzt der Krieg war.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174657&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'511c91c8-7db2-42d3-8fae-fd061471d922\', \'multiverseId\': 174657}, \'multiverseid\': 174657}, {\'name\': \'Mellador de Páramo Ceniciento\', \'text\': \'El Mellador de Páramo Ceniciento no puede bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Después de que sus manos se gastaron, dejándolo sólo con puntas afiladas, decidió que su único propósito sería la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8eb40c99-5f62-43f8-9393-3a581d843189\', \'multiverseId\': 172851}, \'multiverseid\': 172851}, {\'name\': \'Évideur de Cendrelande\', \'text\': "L\'Évideur de Cendrelande ne peut pas bloquer.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Quand ses mains furent tombées en cendres, ne lui laissant que des os griffus, il décida qu\'il n\'avait plus qu\'une fonction : la guerre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173453&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f66a0b6a-72e0-4f5b-a9d6-6c3f7cca54c2\', \'multiverseId\': 173453}, \'multiverseid\': 173453}, {\'name\': \'Perforatore della Brughiera Grigia\', \'text\': \'Il Perforatore della Brughiera Grigia non può bloccare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Dopo che le sue mani si furono sbriciolate, lasciandogli crudeli punte affilate, decise che il suo unico scopo sarebbe stato la guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bc6098c1-d6bd-4fb6-9e9e-66c8ec0db461\', \'multiverseId\': 173754}, \'multiverseid\': 173754}, {\'name\': \'アッシェンムーアの抉り出し\', \'text\': \'アッシェンムーアの抉り出しではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'手が崩れ去り、尖った先のみが奇妙にも残されたと知ったとき、彼は自身の目的は戦争しかないと決めた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7c99f9c-fdc7-4d74-a8cd-1911b5c7ffcf\', \'multiverseId\': 174055}, \'multiverseid\': 174055}, {\'name\': \'Goivador do Pântano das Cinzas\', \'text\': \'Goivador do Pântano das Cinzas não pode bloquear.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Depois que suas mãos se fragmentaram, deixando apenas terríveis pontas afiadas, ele decidiu que seu único propósito era a guerra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172249&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'155d0fd5-c58a-4afb-bc89-1fdf3508378c\', \'multiverseId\': 172249}, \'multiverseid\': 172249}, {\'name\': \'Бурав Выжженной Пустоши\', \'text\': \'Бурав Выжженной Пустоши не может блокировать.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Воин\', \'flavor\': \'После того как руки его искрошились, и вместо них остались лишь ужасные заостренные концы, он решил, что его единственным делом будет война.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172550&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2c08db3-9cb5-4de6-aae2-64adeec51c45\', \'multiverseId\': 172550}, \'multiverseid\': 172550}, {\'name\': \'灰原凿手\', \'text\': \'灰原凿手不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素／战士\', \'flavor\': \'在双手崩坏成奇型尖刺后，他决定把精力全部投入战争。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e065501-9100-401d-82b7-4a5dfd934952\', \'multiverseId\': 173152}, \'multiverseid\': 173152}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufopferungsvoller Druide\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}.\\nLege eine -1/-1-Marke auf den Aufopferungsvollen Druiden: Enttappe den Aufopferungsvollen Druiden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Mana findet sich in allen Dingen, selbst in den Tiefen des eigenen Herzens."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'42ef7e1d-a947-4fbd-8b1d-94acfc1c5d45\', \'multiverseId\': 174587}, \'multiverseid\': 174587}, {\'name\': \'Druida devoto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G} a tu reserva de maná.\\nPon un contador -1/-1 sobre el Druida devoto: Endereza el Druida devoto.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"El maná está en todas las cosas, incluso en las profundidades de tu propio corazón."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172781&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b4b3731-58af-4043-8f1f-99b3d7932699\', \'multiverseId\': 172781}, \'multiverseid\': 172781}, {\'name\': \'Druidesse dévouée\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G} à votre réserve.\\nMettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur la Druidesse dévouée : Dégagez la Druidesse dévouée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': \'« Le mana est dans toutes choses, même au plus profond de votre cœur. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173383&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bfb6ae1-65bb-4b7b-8c20-37eceab94894\', \'multiverseId\': 173383}, \'multiverseid\': 173383}, {\'name\': \'Druido Devoto\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G} alla tua riserva di mana.\\nMetti un segnalino -1/-1 sul Druido Devoto: STAPpa il Druido Devoto.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il mana si nasconde in tutte le cose, anche nelle profondità del cuore di ciascuno."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173684&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54ea95b5-63ba-4a42-aa30-7ea51c5e3c70\', \'multiverseId\': 173684}, \'multiverseid\': 173684}, {\'name\': \'献身のドルイド\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}を加える。\\n献身のドルイドの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く：献身のドルイドをアンタップする。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「マナはすべての物の中に潜んでいます。人の心の奥深くにも。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'61541540-9501-427a-9dd7-fc5baf821022\', \'multiverseId\': 173985}, \'multiverseid\': 173985}, {\'name\': \'Druida Devotado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G} à sua reserva de mana.\\nColoque um marcador -1/-1 em Druida Devotado: Desvire Druida Devotado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O mana oculta-se em todas as coisas, até mesmo nas profundezas do próprio coração."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172179&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aa0d0051-7350-479c-b93c-f6c867b23536\', \'multiverseId\': 172179}, \'multiverseid\': 172179}, {\'name\': \'Самоотверженный Друид\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {G} в ваше хранилище маны.\\nПоложите один жетон -1/-1 на Самоотверженного Друида: разверните Самоотверженного Друида.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Мана кроется во всем, даже в глубине вашего собственного сердца».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e120fdf-bdef-4d73-80b8-a42987bc36ba\', \'multiverseId\': 172480}, \'multiverseid\': 172480}, {\'name\': \'虔诚德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}到你的法术力池中。\\n在虔诚德鲁伊上放置一个-1/-1指示物：重置虔诚德鲁伊。\', \'type\': \'生物～地精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「魔力存于万物之中，就算在心底深处也一样。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173082&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98f4d977-d779-4285-a3b6-54a6025f153c\', \'multiverseId\': 173082}, \'multiverseid\': 173082}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aussortierendes Blätterdach\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine fliegende Kreatur dich angreift, fügt ihr das Aussortierende Blätterdach 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Rabenrevier ist erwacht, und die Zeiten sind vorbei, da Raben in den Ästen krächzten." —Roon Schauderborke\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174604&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b977387-c609-4265-a5e7-9a2bfcfc6562\', \'multiverseId\': 174604}, \'multiverseid\': 174604}, {\'name\': \'Enramada rastrilladora\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura que tenga la habilidad de volar te ataque, la Enramada rastrilladora le hace 4 puntos de daño.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Coto de Cuervos se ha despertado, y los cuervos ya no llorarán en sus ramas." —Roon Cortezapálida\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94a3582e-24c4-438a-9122-da1954f9cac7\', \'multiverseId\': 172798}, \'multiverseid\': 172798}, {\'name\': \'Canopée ratissante\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature avec le vol vous attaque, la Canopée ratissante lui inflige 4 blessures.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« La Garenne du Corbeau s\'est éveillée, et les corbeaux ne croassent plus dans ses branches. » —Vermillon Pâlécorce", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173400&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'500494a5-5c55-4957-abcc-8937acefb9ab\', \'multiverseId\': 173400}, \'multiverseid\': 173400}, {\'name\': \'Fronde Artigliate\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura con volare ti attacca, le Fronde Artigliate infliggono 4 danni a quella creatura.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Volo del Corvo si è svegliato e i corvi non piangeranno più tra le sue fronde." —Roon dalla Bianca Corteccia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a60f45c3-36a2-44ab-bf1c-cc40c7b9efa0\', \'multiverseId\': 173701}, \'multiverseid\': 173701}, {\'name\': \'掻き集める梢\', \'text\': \'いずれかの飛行を持つクリーチャーがあなたを攻撃するたび、掻き集める梢はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「レイヴンの地は目覚めた。もうカラスどもが枝で鳴くことも無い。」 ――恐樹皮のルン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174002&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f179e4f-9c31-442f-9e1d-1e30acdaf155\', \'multiverseId\': 174002}, \'multiverseid\': 174002}, {\'name\': \'Copas Pontiagudas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura com voar o atacar, Copas Pontiagudas causará 4 pontos de dano ela.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"A Toca do Corvo despertou, e os corvos não cantarão mais em seus galhos." — Roon Tronco-Pálido\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172196&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ec9ef0d-a6e8-4e02-8e11-075fdf5b067c\', \'multiverseId\': 172196}, \'multiverseid\': 172196}, {\'name\': \'Хищный Полог\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вас атакует существо с Полетом, Хищный Полог наносит ему 4 повреждения.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Вороновы Угодья уже пробудились ни один ворон не каркнет больше в здешних ветвях». — Рун Белокорый\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172497&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9b700b8-6879-4d6e-8772-8176f8f44cbd\', \'multiverseId\': 172497}, \'multiverseid\': 172497}, {\'name\': \'舞动树冠\', \'text\': \'每当一个具飞行异能的生物攻击你时，舞动树冠对它造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「黑鸦地已经苏醒，黑鸦将再也无法于该地枝头上鸣叫。」 ～白皮木伦恩\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173099&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dcaa4b0-fbe7-4f56-bfc1-fc9ed2a6b532\', \'multiverseId\': 173099}, \'multiverseid\': 173099}]', '[{\'name\': \'Baumreiche Bastion\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{G/W}, {T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {G}{G}, {G}{W} oder {W}{W}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Die Elfen des Gilblaubwaldes erweitern die Palisade rund um das Rückzugsgebiet ständig. Sie hoffen, eines Tages den ganzen Wald mit ihren Befestigungen umschließen zu können.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174758&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a9de881-473b-4464-9ccd-3015a7301266\', \'multiverseId\': 174758}, \'multiverseid\': 174758}, {\'name\': \'Bastión arbolado\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{G/W}, {T}: Agrega {G}{G}, {G}{W}, o {W}{W} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'Los elfos del Bosque de Hojas Marchitas continuamente expanden la estacada que rodea el santuario. Tienen la esperanza de algún día contener todo el bosque dentro de sus muros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5750bf86-c61e-4adf-9221-d885fdb4babd\', \'multiverseId\': 172952}, \'multiverseid\': 172952}, {\'name\': \'Bastion boisé\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{G/W}, {T} : Ajoutez {G}{G}, {G}{W} ou {W}{W} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': \'Les elfes du Bois de Feuilleterne étendent continuellement la palissade qui entoure le sanctuaire. Ils espèrent un jour encercler toute la forêt dans ses murs.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173554&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2397330f-a718-4f0e-afde-d6b9c7fc8bbf\', \'multiverseId\': 173554}, \'multiverseid\': 173554}, {\'name\': \'Bastione Arboreo\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{G/W}, {T}: Aggiungi {G}{G}, {G}{W}, o {W}{W} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "Gli elfi del Bosco Foglia Secca allungano continuamente la palizzata che circonda il santuario. Sperano un giorno di poter racchiudere l\'intera foresta all\'interno delle sue mura.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d02475b-3817-48f1-bb44-bc8de0c84b67\', \'multiverseId\': 173855}, \'multiverseid\': 173855}, {\'name\': \'樹木茂る砦\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n, {T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{G}{G}か{G}{W}か{W}{W}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'萎れ葉の森のエルフは、聖地を囲んでその領域の柵を広げ続けている。 いつの日か森全体をその壁で覆うのが願いだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174156&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eddb4ad7-4dae-4e1a-9d36-25a12d4eeacf\', \'multiverseId\': 174156}, \'multiverseid\': 174156}, {\'name\': \'Bastião Florestal\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{G/W}, {T}: Adicione {G}{G}, {G}{W} ou {W}{W} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'Os elfos da Floresta de Folha Seca expandem continuamente a cerca que circunda o santuário. Eles esperam um dia confinar toda a floresta dentro de suas muralhas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172350&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4c30fcba-178d-4369-a003-6d5e943dc132\', \'multiverseId\': 172350}, \'multiverseid\': 172350}, {\'name\': \'Лесной Бастион\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{G/W}, {T}: добавьте {G}{G}, {G}{W} или {W}{W} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Эльфы Темнолесья постоянно расширяют частокол вокруг своего святилища. Они надеются в один прекрасный день укрыть весь лес в его стенах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172651&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f27eab65-10ae-4a50-8504-a77c93e89270\', \'multiverseId\': 172651}, \'multiverseid\': 172651}, {\'name\': \'林木堡垒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。\\n{G/W}，{T}：加{G}{G}，{G}{W}，或{W}{W}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'枯叶林地精继续扩建围护避难所的栅栏。 他们希望有一天能将整座树林都用墙包起来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173253&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ecd669-2fee-4adf-bb13-9ca61c2ca4d0\', \'multiverseId\': 173253}, \'multiverseid\': 173253}]', '[{\'name\': \'Behauene Steinpyramiden\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {1}.\\n{B/R}, {T}: Erhöhe deinen Manavorrat um {B}{B}, {B}{R} oder {R}{R}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'„Hier stahl die Auslöscherin das Licht der Welt. Hier werden wir sie opfern, damit unser Volk das große Wiederentflammen feiern kann." —Illulia von der Nachtesse\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174749&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c9c52df-97a9-476b-b56c-ad4991a097a2\', \'multiverseId\': 174749}, \'multiverseid\': 174749}, {\'name\': \'Hitos esculpidos\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {1} a tu reserva de maná.\\n{B/R}, {T}: Agrega {B}{B}, {B}{R}, o {R}{R} a tu reserva de maná.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'"Aquí la Extinguidora robó la luz del mundo. Aquí la sacrificaremos para traer el Gran Encendido a nuestra gente." —Illulia de Fogón Nocturno\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172943&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79564f50-8134-48c2-8798-3c9a60a07924\', \'multiverseId\': 172943}, \'multiverseid\': 172943}, {\'name\': \'Cairns sculptés\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {1} à votre réserve.\\n{B/R}, {T} : Ajoutez {B}{B}, {B}{R} ou {R}{R} à votre réserve.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "« C\'est ici que l\'Extincteur a volé la lumière du monde. C\'est ici que nous le sacrifierons pour apporter le Grand Allumement à notre peuple. » —Illulia des Noctâtres", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173545&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7fe28fc-eef0-4f76-b421-16364cb770f4\', \'multiverseId\': 173545}, \'multiverseid\': 173545}, {\'name\': \'Tumuli Scolpiti\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {1} alla tua riserva di mana.\\n{B/R}, {T}: Aggiungi {B}{B}, {B}{R}, o {R}{R} alla tua riserva di mana.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': \'"Qui l\\\'Estintrice ha rubato la luce dal mondo. Qui la sacrificheremo, per portare la Grande Accensione alle nostre genti." —Illulia del Tetro Focolare\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173846&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'727422ef-831d-4d99-9a5a-add399a3e859\', \'multiverseId\': 173846}, \'multiverseid\': 173846}, {\'name\': \'偶像の石塚\', \'text\': \'{T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{1}を加える。\\n, {T}：あなたのマナ・プールに{B}{B}か{B}{R}か{R}{R}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'「『鎮める者』が世界から光を奪ったのがここだ。 ここで我々は彼女を生け贄とし、我々に『偉大なる再燃』をもたらすのだ。」 ――ナイトハースのイルリア\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'881c7d15-c7ab-4e76-babc-0c290b29d6f7\', \'multiverseId\': 174147}, \'multiverseid\': 174147}, {\'name\': \'Caerne Esculpido\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {1} à sua reserva de mana.\\n{B/R}, {T}: Adicione {B}{B}, {B}{R} ou {R}{R} à sua reserva de mana.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'"Foi aqui que a Extintora roubou a luz do mundo. É aqui que a sacrificaremos para trazer o Grande Reacendimento ao nosso povo." — Illulia, dos Larescuro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172341&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d66ea50f-7be7-430c-90b9-f7ab40877047\', \'multiverseId\': 172341}, \'multiverseid\': 172341}, {\'name\': \'Высеченные Курганы\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {1} в ваше хранилище маны.\\n{B/R}, {T}: добавьте {B}{B}, {B}{R} или {R}{R} в ваше хранилище маны.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'«На этом месте Гасительница похитила у мира свет. Здесь же мы и принесем ее в жертву, чтобы подарить нашему народу Великое Разжигание». — Иллулия из культа темносветов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172642&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d08bfcd-9b6a-4f04-a1e4-fc775b54f250\', \'multiverseId\': 172642}, \'multiverseid\': 172642}, {\'name\': \'铭刻圆石\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{1}到你的法术力池中。\\n{B/R}，{T}：加{B}{B}，{B}{R}，或{R}{R}到你的法术力池中。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'「在此地，熄焰者将世界的光明偷走。 在此地，我们终能将其献祭，让伟大重燃者重归族人。」 ～夜炉的伊璐里\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173244&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70c9c4ed-a4a4-4cf9-8477-0e1745dfe0c1\', \'multiverseId\': 173244}, \'multiverseid\': 173244}]', "[{'name': 'Beunruhigender Plan', 'text': 'Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl aus einem Friedhof auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück.\\nVerschwören (Sowie du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kannst du zwei ungetappte Kreaturen tappen, die du kontrollierst und die mindestens eine Farbe mit dem Zauberspruch gemeinsam haben. Wenn du das tust, kopiere den Zauberspruch; du kannst für die Kopie ein neues Ziel bestimmen.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174541&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e5c9d7f8-8237-4ad5-9a12-712e1206202b', 'multiverseId': 174541}, 'multiverseid': 174541}, {'name': 'Plan perturbador', 'text': 'Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo en un cementerio a la mano de su propietario.\\nConspirar. (En cuanto juegues este hechizo puedes girar dos criaturas enderezadas que controles que compartan un color con él. Cuando lo hagas, cópialo y puedes elegir un nuevo objetivo para la copia.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172735&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b13a62ff-944e-48da-adeb-e18ab6b3e649', 'multiverseId': 172735}, 'multiverseid': 172735}, {'name': 'Conspiration troublante', 'text': 'Renvoyez la carte de créature ciblée dans un cimetière dans la main de son propriétaire.\\nConspiration (Au moment où vous jouez ce sort, vous pouvez engager deux créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez qui partagent une couleur avec lui. Quand vous faites ainsi, copiez-le et vous pouvez choisir une nouvelle cible pour la copie.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173337&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '46e1973d-ad24-42bc-9dfb-611034bfc61a', 'multiverseId': 173337}, 'multiverseid': 173337}, {'name': 'Complotto Inquietante', 'text': 'Fai tornare una carta creatura bersaglio in un cimitero in mano al suo proprietario.\\nCospirare (Mentre giochi questa magia, puoi TAPpare due creature STAPpate che controlli che condividono un colore con essa. Quando lo fai, copia la magia. Puoi scegliere un nuovo bersaglio per la copia.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173638&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5340379f-a889-41df-b435-ffc00a6e82c0', 'multiverseId': 173638}, 'multiverseid': 173638}, {'name': '困惑する策謀', 'text': 'いずれかの墓地にあるクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。\\n共謀 （この呪文をプレイするに際し、あなたはあなたがコントロールするこの呪文と共通の色を持つアンタップ状態のクリーチャー２体をタップしてもよい。 そうした場合、この呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新たな対象を選んでもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173939&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '11547f39-abb7-4975-a81c-15e88e473423', 'multiverseId': 173939}, 'multiverseid': 173939}, {'name': 'Conspiração Perturbadora', 'text': 'Devolva o card de criatura alvo que esteja num cemitério para a mão de seu dono.\\nConspirar (Conforme você joga essa mágica, você pode virar duas criaturas desviradas que você controla e que compartilhem uma cor com ela. Quando fizer isso, faça uma cópia dela e você poderá escolher um novo alvo para a cópia.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172133&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '94f9bb13-5687-4518-8c8d-294203e7684d', 'multiverseId': 172133}, 'multiverseid': 172133}, {'name': 'Недобрый Замысел', 'text': 'Верните целевую карту существа из кладбища в руку ее владельца.\\nЗаговор (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете повернуть два неповернутых существа под вашим контролем, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него. Когда вы это делаете, скопируйте его, и вы можете выбрать новую цель для этой копии.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172434&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '58e0a92e-9fc1-4bdb-b926-297f60d1a0c9', 'multiverseId': 172434}, 'multiverseid': 172434}, {'name': '搅扰阴谋', 'text': '将目标生物牌从坟墓场移回其拥有者手上。\\n协力 （于你使用此咒语时，你可以横置两个由你操控、且与此咒语有共通颜色的未横置生物。 当你如此作，则复制此咒语，且你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173036&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ded1a1a6-f361-4458-b91a-aa0a86d17bb3', 'multiverseId': 173036}, 'multiverseid': 173036}]", '[{\'name\': \'Bleicher Wanderer\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}{W}, {Q}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält bis zum Ende des Zuges Schutz vor einer Farbe, die ihr Beherrscher bestimmt. ({Q} ist das Enttappsymbol.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Geist, Riese\', \'flavor\': \'Während er durchs Schattenmoor wanderte, konnte er sich nicht mehr an sein Verbrechen erinnern — nur noch an die Schande.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174494&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6b76f7e-a446-4c6b-bbe0-d7516a9bb8dc\', \'multiverseId\': 174494}, \'multiverseid\': 174494}, {\'name\': \'Caminante pálido\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}{W}, {Q}: La criatura objetivo gana protección contra el color de elección de su controlador hasta el final del turno. ({Q} es el símbolo de enderezar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espíritu gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Vagaba por el Páramo Sombrío, sin recordar su crimen, sólo su pena.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c30499-68f4-4cca-a1a7-9984dffe6e6c\', \'multiverseId\': 172688}, \'multiverseid\': 172688}, {\'name\': \'Voyageur pâle\', \'text\': "{2}{W}{W}, {Q} : La créature ciblée acquiert la protection contre la couleur du choix de son contrôleur jusqu\'à la fin du tour. ({Q} est le symbole de dégagement.)", \'type\': \'Créature : esprit et géant\', \'flavor\': \'Errant dans Sombrelande, il ne se rappelait pas son crime — seulement sa honte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173290&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b87ca92e-28e9-4168-ac7c-0b0d0b643373\', \'multiverseId\': 173290}, \'multiverseid\': 173290}, {\'name\': \'Viandante Pallido\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}{W}, {Q}: Una creatura bersaglio ha protezione da un colore a scelta del suo controllore fino alla fine del turno. ({Q} è il simbolo di STAP.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spirito Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre vagava per la Landa Tenebrosa, non ripensava al suo crimine... solo alla sua vergogna.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4891e80c-5ced-4b83-b585-e28c4b3ca475\', \'multiverseId\': 173591}, \'multiverseid\': 173591}, {\'name\': \'青ざめた旅人\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}{W}, {Q}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。それはターン終了時まで、それのコントローラーが選んだ色１色に対するプロテクションを得る。 （{Q}はアンタップ・シンボルである。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スピリット・巨人\', \'flavor\': \'シャドウムーアをさまよう彼らが覚えているのは自身の罪ではない――自身の恥だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7272e29a-d10a-4845-8659-60361eabd6b7\', \'multiverseId\': 173892}, \'multiverseid\': 173892}, {\'name\': \'Caminhante Pálido\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}{W}, {Q}: A criatura alvo ganha proteção contra a cor da escolha de seu controlador até o final do turno. ({Q} é o símbolo de desvirar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espírito Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Enquanto perambulava por Pântano Sombrio, ele não se lembrava de seu nome, somente de sua vergonha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172086&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de09d34e-80ba-48ab-83b7-5ee660d21818\', \'multiverseId\': 172086}, \'multiverseid\': 172086}, {\'name\': \'Бледный Странник\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}{W}, {Q}: целевое существо получает Защиту от цвета, выбранного контролирующим его игроком, до конца хода. ({Q} символ разворота карты.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дух Гигант\', \'flavor\': \'Скитаясь по Шэдоумуру, он помнил не преступление, а лишь свой позор.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba21b265-c0fd-4f01-b55c-441e66892617\', \'multiverseId\': 172387}, \'multiverseid\': 172387}, {\'name\': \'苍白旅人\', \'text\': \'{2}{W}{W}，{Q}：目标生物的操控者选择一种颜色，它获得反该色保护异能直到回合结束。 （{Q}是重置符号。）\', \'type\': \'生物～精怪／巨人\', \'flavor\': \'它在暗影荒原四处游荡，不记得自己犯下的罪过～只记得其耻辱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172989&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aef29fee-e08a-41e7-abc1-f0f27111aebf\', \'multiverseId\': 172989}, \'multiverseid\': 172989}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzeichen-Mentor\', \'text\': \'Rote Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, haben Erstschlag.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Boggarts teilen alles auf der Welt in zwei Kategorien ein: Sachen, die man essen kann, und Sachen, die man jagen und tothauen muss, bevor man sie essen kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174560&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e289afef-6978-4d0a-bf3d-685b5c14aed9\', \'multiverseId\': 174560}, \'multiverseid\': 174560}, {\'name\': \'Mentor marca de sangre\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas rojas que controles tienen la habilidad de dañar primero.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Los boggarts dividen el mundo en dos categorías: las cosas que puedes comer y las cosas que debes atrapar y golpear antes de poder comerlas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172754&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f136c24-6e88-4ab4-9b19-ab99f2e61124\', \'multiverseId\': 172754}, \'multiverseid\': 172754}, {\'name\': \'Mentor marquesang\', \'text\': "Les créatures rouges que vous contrôlez ont l\'initiative.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': \'Les boggarts divisent le monde en deux catégories : ce qui est mangeable, et ce qui doit être chassé et attendri avant de pouvoir être mangé.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173356&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3863463-d12b-46fd-a827-d01b345e5844\', \'multiverseId\': 173356}, \'multiverseid\': 173356}, {\'name\': \'Mentore dal Marchio di Sangue\', \'text\': \'Le creature rosse che controlli hanno attacco improvviso.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'I boggart dividono il mondo in due categorie: cose che puoi mangiare e cose che devi scovare e colpire più volte prima di poterle mangiare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173657&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39f889f8-d6d6-4e4b-97e2-225b5bad9c63\', \'multiverseId\': 173657}, \'multiverseid\': 173657}, {\'name\': \'血印の導師\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールする赤のクリーチャーは先制攻撃を持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'ボガートは世界を二つに分類している。食える物と、追っかけてぶん殴らないと食えない物だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173958&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b47968c8-26fe-4f90-8224-6d79ea8f6bfd\', \'multiverseId\': 173958}, \'multiverseid\': 173958}, {\'name\': \'Mentor Mancha-Sangrenta\', \'text\': \'As criaturas vermelhas que você controla têm iniciativa.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Os papões dividem o mundo em duas categorias: coisas que podem ser devoradas e coisas que devem primeiro ser caçadas e esmurradas antes que possam ser devoradas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172152&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b355b57d-4028-4058-9c12-8148202e8a50\', \'multiverseId\': 172152}, \'multiverseid\': 172152}, {\'name\': \'Наставник, Алчущий Крови\', \'text\': \'Красные существа под вашим контролем имеют Первый удар.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'В понимании боггартов мир делится на две категории: то, что можно съесть сразу, и то, что сначала нужно поймать и хорошенько отдубасить.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'805fea1c-5246-4ff3-8ee8-4329d491aa19\', \'multiverseId\': 172453}, \'multiverseid\': 172453}, {\'name\': \'血戳明师\', \'text\': \'由你操控的红色生物具有先攻异能。\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵／战士\', \'flavor\': \'波尬将举世事物分成两类：能吃的，以及得先追逐、拳打后才能吃的。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173055&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a18bd1f0-6888-4e44-a724-d80dab1ffc6b\', \'multiverseId\': 173055}, \'multiverseid\': 173055}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boggart-Brandstifter\', \'text\': \'Ebenentarnung\\n{2}{R}, opfere die Boggart-Brandstifter: Zerstöre eine Vogelscheuche oder eine Ebene deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Räuber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Aurora verwandelte Nibb und Gyik von Tunichtguten zu wilden Zerstörern. Wie man sicher mit seinen Werkzeugen umgeht, lernten sie nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174562&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d95f596f-5db8-403d-805a-c50880c17bc4\', \'multiverseId\': 174562}, \'multiverseid\': 174562}, {\'name\': \'Incendiarios boggart\', \'text\': \'Cruza llanuras.\\n{2}{R}, sacrificar los Incendiarios boggart: Destruye la llanura o el Espantapájaros objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Bribón trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'La Aurora Celeste transformó a Nibb y Gyik de traviesos en merodeadores salvajes. Todavía no saben mucho sobre el uso seguro de herramientas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74e397b7-cf1c-47d5-9176-e2643b82a617\', \'multiverseId\': 172756}, \'multiverseid\': 172756}, {\'name\': \'Incendiaires boggarts\', \'text\': "Traversée des plaines\\n{2}{R}, sacrifiez les Incendiaires boggarts : Détruisez l\'épouvantail ciblé ou la plaine ciblée.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et gredin\', \'flavor\': "L\'Aurore avait transformé les cabotins Nibb et Gyik en maraudeurs sauvages. Cependant, ils n\'étaient toujours pas très doués de leurs mains.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173358&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e059d4ec-be05-47d0-b1c2-5b4c022f6515\', \'multiverseId\': 173358}, \'multiverseid\': 173358}, {\'name\': \'Piromani Boggart\', \'text\': \'Passa-Pianure\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifica i Piromani Boggart: Distruggi uno Spaventapasseri o una Pianura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Farabutto Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'La Luminaria ha trasformato Nibb e Gyik da semplici briganti in predoni furiosi. Nonostante ciò, continuano a ignorare la sicurezza degli attrezzi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173659&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5b8a7fc-90ea-45e3-b648-94696d56e2d1\', \'multiverseId\': 173659}, \'multiverseid\': 173659}, {\'name\': \'ボガートの放火魔\', \'text\': \'平地渡り\\n{2}{R}, ボガートの放火魔を生け贄に捧げる：カカシ１つか平地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・ならず者\', \'flavor\': \'オーロラはニブとギィクをただの悪戯者から凶暴な略奪者へと変えてしまった。 もっとも、安全というものの使い道はいまだに理解していない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9737577a-105e-4b8a-be0c-c2ac69275f1e\', \'multiverseId\': 173960}, \'multiverseid\': 173960}, {\'name\': \'Pirômanos Papões\', \'text\': \'Travessia de planície\\n{2}{R}, Sacrifique Pirômanos Papões: Destrua o Espantalho ou a Planície alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Ladino\', \'flavor\': \'A Aurora transformou Nibb e Gyik de traquinas em saqueadores ferozes. No entanto, eles ainda não sabem muito sobre como manusear suas ferramentas com segurança.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68b2f123-c337-470a-b8cc-e3a03dc75b7f\', \'multiverseId\': 172154}, \'multiverseid\': 172154}, {\'name\': \'Боггарты-Поджигатели\', \'text\': \'Знание Равнин\\n{2}{R}, пожертвуйте Боггартов-Поджигателей: уничтожьте целевое Пугало или Равнину.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Бродяга\', \'flavor\': \'Аврора превратила проказников Нибба и Гика в свирепых мародеров. Но безопасное обращение с инструментом они так и не освоили.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2067bce5-2021-4a23-bae8-59f03b1d0b60\', \'multiverseId\': 172455}, \'multiverseid\': 172455}, {\'name\': \'纵火波尬\', \'text\': \'平原行者\\n{2}{R}，牺牲纵火波尬：消灭目标稻草人或平原。\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵／浪客\', \'flavor\': \'极光将尼布与吉可从捣蛋鬼转化为野蛮劫掠者。 而他们对工具安全依旧没什么概念。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdd26ebd-2359-4731-8092-f92d81aad0df\', \'multiverseId\': 173057}, \'multiverseid\': 173057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boggart-Rammbande\', \'text\': \'Eile\\nVerdorren (Dies fügt Kreaturen Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'„Wir benötigen ein größeres Tor." —Bowen, Kapitän der Wache von Barrenton\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174680&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b580d852-94e4-4048-8b5f-f2c227595956\', \'multiverseId\': 174680}, \'multiverseid\': 174680}, {\'name\': \'Arieteros boggart\', \'text\': \'Prisa.\\nDebilitar. (Esta fuente hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos a necesitar una puerta más grande." —Bowen, capitán de la guardia de Bárrenton\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d718ff4-a847-48cb-adfb-bf050d0dcbaa\', \'multiverseId\': 172874}, \'multiverseid\': 172874}, {\'name\': \'Gang du bélier boggart\', \'text\': \'Célérité\\nFlétrissure (Cette source inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "« Nous allons avoir besoin d\'une porte plus grande. » —Bowen, capitaine de la garde de Barrenton", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173476&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9253da5-1f84-4558-acb0-2af9565f3942\', \'multiverseId\': 173476}, \'multiverseid\': 173476}, {\'name\': "Squadra d\'Assalto Boggart", \'text\': \'Rapidità\\nAvvizzire (Una fonte con avvizzire infligge danno sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'"Avremo bisogno di un cancello più grande." —Bowen, capitano delle guardie di Barrenton\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32720d56-7823-40bf-bf89-946cc06f7763\', \'multiverseId\': 173777}, \'multiverseid\': 173777}, {\'name\': \'ボガートの突撃隊\', \'text\': \'速攻\\n萎縮 （これはクリーチャーに－１/－１カウンターの形でダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「もっとでかい門がいるんだろうなぁ。」 ――バレントンの護衛長、ボウエン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174078&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed400eac-f7f0-47bb-8fe1-eb22a62cb71b\', \'multiverseId\': 174078}, \'multiverseid\': 174078}, {\'name\': \'Gangue do Aríete Papão\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto\\nMurchar (Esta fonte causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Vamos precisar de um portão maior." — Bowen, capitão da guarda de Barrenton\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10d8475b-755d-4db1-aad8-e20aaf36c8bd\', \'multiverseId\': 172272}, \'multiverseid\': 172272}, {\'name\': \'Боггарты-Таранщики\', \'text\': \'Ускорение\\nУвядание (Этот источник наносит повреждения существам в виде жетонов -1/-1.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'«Нам будут нужны ворота побольше». — Боуэн, командир стражников Баррентона\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb436a32-7e81-4ca5-b7ef-650a5a1c3e13\', \'multiverseId\': 172573}, \'multiverseid\': 172573}, {\'name\': \'波尬攻城组\', \'text\': \'敏捷\\n干枯 （此来源会以-1/-1指示物的方式对生物造成伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵／战士\', \'flavor\': \'「我们得要有个更大的门。」 ～八连屯卫队长伯文\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'34a197a8-f2a1-4804-8736-8b9325fdc7bd\', \'multiverseId\': 173175}, \'multiverseid\': 173175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boggarthorde\', \'text\': \'Stärke und Widerstandskraft der Boggarthorde sind gleich der Anzahl der roten bleibenden Karten, die du kontrollierst.\\nDie Boggarthorde kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Die einzige Strategie, die den Verstand der wilden Boggarts nicht überfordert, ist der direkte Angriff.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174571&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4dda335-e8cc-4eac-9e3c-5846301d6dd9\', \'multiverseId\': 174571}, \'multiverseid\': 174571}, {\'name\': \'Horda de boggarts\', \'text\': \'Tanto la fuerza como la resistencia de la Horda de boggarts son iguales a la cantidad de permanentes rojos que controlas.\\nLa Horda de boggarts no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Las mentes simples de los boggart no entienden de estrategias, pero el ataque frontal hasta ahora no les falló.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c114795-ae32-4bfe-b84c-ed0aa9e8f0aa\', \'multiverseId\': 172765}, \'multiverseid\': 172765}, {\'name\': \'Horde de boggarts\', \'text\': "La force et l\'endurance de la Horde de boggarts sont chacune égale au nombre de permanents rouges que vous contrôlez.\\nLa Horde de boggarts ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.", \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin\', \'flavor\': "La stratégie est un concept étranger pour l\'esprit sauvage des boggarts, mais la charge en masse leur réussit toujours.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173367&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439db954-b953-4f5f-872e-b455747098c2\', \'multiverseId\': 173367}, \'multiverseid\': 173367}, {\'name\': \'Orda di Boggart\', \'text\': "La forza e la costituzione dell\'Orda di Boggart sono pari al numero di permanenti rossi che controlli.\\nL\'Orda di Boggart non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Le strategie non si sviluppano facilmente nelle ferali menti dei boggart, ma i loro assalti frontali non hanno mai fallito.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71a6d0d1-62e7-4fda-bb7a-dcb3783daf86\', \'multiverseId\': 173668}, \'multiverseid\': 173668}, {\'name\': \'ボガートの群れ\', \'text\': \'ボガートの群れのパワーとタフネスは、それぞれあなたがコントロールする赤のパーマネントの総数に等しい。\\nボガートの群れは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン\', \'flavor\': \'ボガートの原始的な頭には戦略というものは簡単には飲み込めないが、全軍突撃なら失敗したためしがない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee00ea71-7151-447b-a64f-2d8b377bb384\', \'multiverseId\': 173969}, \'multiverseid\': 173969}, {\'name\': \'Horda de Papões\', \'text\': \'O poder e resistência de Horda de Papões são ambos iguais ao número de permanentes vermelhas que você controla.\\nHorda de Papões só pode ser bloqueado por duas ou mais criaturas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'As mentes impetuosas dos papões não criam estratégias com facilidade, mas eles ainda não tiveram nenhum problema com o ataque voraz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172163&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7931eba0-9458-4749-90e6-61a10eb1152c\', \'multiverseId\': 172163}, \'multiverseid\': 172163}, {\'name\': \'Орда Боггартов\', \'text\': \'Сила и выносливость Орды Боггартов равны количеству красных перманентов под вашим контролем.\\nОрда Боггартов не может быть заблокирована менее чем двумя существами.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин\', \'flavor\': \'Дикий разум боггартов с трудом воспринимает тонкую стратегию, но с грубым натиском всегда справляется легко.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f34f31c-8743-47f8-a2bd-b78f98cae531\', \'multiverseId\': 172464}, \'multiverseid\': 172464}, {\'name\': \'波尬大军\', \'text\': \'波尬大军的力量及防御力各等同于由你操控的红色永久物之数量。\\n波尬大军只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～精灵\', \'flavor\': \'波尬的野蛮心智不容易想到什么策略，但全面攻击从来都足以奏效。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'51986950-09cd-4d1d-b72c-56b5f77e4058\', \'multiverseId\': 173066}, \'multiverseid\': 173066}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boshafte Visionen\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn des Ziehsegments jedes Spielers zieht dieser Spieler eine zusätzliche Karte.\\nImmer wenn ein Spieler eine Karte zieht, fügen die Boshaften Visionen diesem Spieler 1 Schadenspunkt zu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'Wissen bringt Desillusionierung mit sich, Schmerz zeigt einem neue Perspektiven auf.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174675&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e6eb26a3-5979-41d0-9682-e858c9a0ff65\', \'multiverseId\': 174675}, \'multiverseid\': 174675}, {\'name\': \'Visiones malévolas\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo del paso de robar de cada jugador, ese jugador roba una carta.\\nSiempre que un jugador robe una carta, las Visiones malévolas le hacen 1 punto de daño a ese jugador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'El conocimiento también atrae la puntada de desilusión, pero el dolor enseña perspectiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'facf2cc3-7492-43ec-b6ee-90b1a23097c7\', \'multiverseId\': 172869}, \'multiverseid\': 172869}, {\'name\': \'Visions de dépit\', \'text\': "Au début de l\'étape de pioche de chaque joueur, ce joueur pioche une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un joueur pioche une carte, les Visions de dépit infligent 1 blessure à ce joueur.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'La connaissance entraîne une douloureuse désillusion, mais la souffrance enseigne la perspective.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173471&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a1228e4-8a49-4e27-9ff4-a31f6e0a5971\', \'multiverseId\': 173471}, \'multiverseid\': 173471}, {\'name\': \'Visioni Astiose\', \'text\': "All\'inizio dell\'acquisizione di ogni giocatore, quel giocatore pesca una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta un giocatore pesca una carta, le Visioni Astiose infliggono 1 danno a quel giocatore.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': "La conoscenza conduce spesso a un\'amara disillusione, ma il dolore aiuta a vedere le cose in prospettiva.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f04663a4-2f7d-4ddd-acbf-588e678c839e\', \'multiverseId\': 173772}, \'multiverseid\': 173772}, {\'name\': \'悪意に満ちた幻視\', \'text\': \'各プレイヤーのドロー･ステップの開始時に、そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚引く。\\nいずれかのプレイヤーがカードを引くたび、悪意に満ちた幻視はそのプレイヤーに１点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'知識は幻滅の痛みをもたらすが、痛みは物の見方を教えてくれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174073&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e7d109d-d632-4a12-bcbd-2f0fe6fd89b9\', \'multiverseId\': 174073}, \'multiverseid\': 174073}, {\'name\': \'Visões Malévolas\', \'text\': \'No início da etapa de compra de cada jogador, aquele jogador compra um card.\\nToda vez que um jogador compra um card, Visões Malévolas causa 1 ponto de dano àquele jogador.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'O conhecimento traz o aguilhão da desilusão, mas a dor ensina a ter perspectiva.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b89aa3d8-1834-4d2e-b52c-df60f8bf9bfb\', \'multiverseId\': 172267}, \'multiverseid\': 172267}, {\'name\': \'Злобные Видения\', \'text\': \'В начале шага взятия карты каждого игрока тот игрок берет карту.\\nКаждый раз, когда игрок берет карту, Злобные Видения наносят 1 повреждение тому игроку.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'Знание приносит муки разочарования, но эта боль учит видеть перспективу.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e8803ed-c7e6-4107-a56d-d699977c524d\', \'multiverseId\': 172568}, \'multiverseid\': 172568}, {\'name\': \'怨毒预视\', \'text\': \'在每位牌手的抓牌步骤开始时，该牌手抓一张牌。\\n每当任一牌手抓一张牌时，怨毒预视对该牌手造成1点伤害。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'知识带来醒悟之痛楚，但这苦痛让人开拓视野。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173170&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73029db0-27f3-42da-94ed-031c8e56d4a2\', \'multiverseId\': 173170}, \'multiverseid\': 173170}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brandmal-Rußwesen\', \'text\': \'Wenn das Brandmal-Rußwesen ins Spiel kommt, lege eine -1/-1-Marke auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Dein verbranntes Fleisch ist nur der erste Schritt deiner Reise der dunklen Erleuchtung."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174659&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbbbfd61-b732-4b5c-9cb8-07a8250b4448\', \'multiverseId\': 174659}, \'multiverseid\': 174659}, {\'name\': \'Ceniciento marca del culto\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Ceniciento marca del culto entre en juego, pon un contador -1/-1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán elemental\', \'flavor\': \'"Tu carne ardiendo será el primer paso en tu camino hacia la sabiduría oscura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172853&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c998776-7cfe-44be-8223-e33c15c9e47c\', \'multiverseId\': 172853}, \'multiverseid\': 172853}, {\'name\': \'Scoriacé marqueculte\', \'text\': \'Quand le Scoriacé marqueculte arrive en jeu, mettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur la créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et shamane\', \'flavor\': "« Ta chair brûlée sera la première étape de ton voyage vers l\'illumination obscure. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173455&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3250e76-d8df-45d4-bb36-69670430bb6d\', \'multiverseId\': 173455}, \'multiverseid\': 173455}, {\'name\': \'Marchiatore Cinereo\', \'text\': \'Quando il Marchiatore Cinereo entra in gioco, metti un segnalino -1/-1 su una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'"L\\\'avvizzimento della carne sarà il primo passo del tuo cammino verso l\\\'illuminazione oscura."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e616bd45-8b7d-453d-b457-d2682ab11d18\', \'multiverseId\': 173756}, \'multiverseid\': 173756}, {\'name\': \'邪教印の燃えがら\', \'text\': \'邪教印の燃えがらが場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「お前の焼けた身体は、闇の悟りの旅への第一歩となる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a3a8228-0b65-4f1f-8130-2fa655b0a0ab\', \'multiverseId\': 174057}, \'multiverseid\': 174057}, {\'name\': \'Cinzeríneo Culto-do-Estigma\', \'text\': \'Quando Cinzeríneo Culto-do-Estigma entrar em jogo, coloque um marcador -1/-1 na criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Sua carne cauterizada será seu primeiro passo rumo à iluminação sombria."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172251&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac51b21c-6dcc-480f-bdbe-45d7cc5cbccb\', \'multiverseId\': 172251}, \'multiverseid\': 172251}, {\'name\': \'Золовик Культового Клейма\', \'text\': \'Когда Золовик Культового Клейма входит в игру, положите один жетон -1/-1 на целевое существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Твоя опаленная плоть станет первым шагом на пути к темному просвещению».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172552&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7c9737d-a6f0-4372-9cf0-8ca5b24e00fe\', \'multiverseId\': 172552}, \'multiverseid\': 172552}, {\'name\': \'烙记烬身\', \'text\': \'当烙记烬身进场时，在目标生物上放置一个-1/-1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～元素／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「焦灼的肉体是你黑暗启蒙之旅的第一步。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173154&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5a23e53-c8a6-47ee-9165-70a7afe3172b\', \'multiverseId\': 173154}, \'multiverseid\': 173154}]', "[{'name': 'Brennender Pfad', 'text': 'Der Brennende Pfad fügt einer Kreatur oder einem Spieler deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nVerschwören (Sowie du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kannst du zwei ungetappte Kreaturen tappen, die du kontrollierst und die mindestens eine Farbe mit dem Zauberspruch gemeinsam haben. Wenn du das tust, kopiere den Zauberspruch; du kannst für die Kopie ein neues Ziel bestimmen.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174563&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8d3f091a-7c0d-4a18-9d46-f8533605d306', 'multiverseId': 174563}, 'multiverseid': 174563}, {'name': 'Rastro ardiente', 'text': 'El Rastro ardiente hace 3 puntos de daño a la criatura o jugador objetivo.\\nConspirar. (En cuanto juegues este hechizo puedes girar dos criaturas enderezadas que controles que compartan un color con él. Cuando lo hagas, cópialo y puedes elegir un nuevo objetivo para la copia.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172757&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3069b064-f39e-4701-805b-ac0f138d64a8', 'multiverseId': 172757}, 'multiverseid': 172757}, {'name': 'Trace de brûlure', 'text': 'La Trace de brûlure inflige 3 blessures à une cible, créature ou joueur.\\nConspiration (Au moment où vous jouez ce sort, vous pouvez engager deux créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez qui partagent une couleur avec lui. Quand vous faites ainsi, copiez-le et vous pouvez choisir une nouvelle cible pour la copie.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173359&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '971e1da1-d1b4-4244-b496-03e555ea5f85', 'multiverseId': 173359}, 'multiverseid': 173359}, {'name': 'Scia Infuocata', 'text': 'La Scia Infuocata infligge 3 danni a una creatura o a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nCospirare (Mentre giochi questa magia, puoi TAPpare due creature STAPpate che controlli che condividono un colore con essa. Quando lo fai, copia la magia. Puoi scegliere un nuovo bersaglio per la copia.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173660&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f1bccd49-f251-444a-afbe-96f32bb046e1', 'multiverseId': 173660}, 'multiverseid': 173660}, {'name': '痕跡焼き', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。痕跡焼きはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\\n共謀 （この呪文をプレイするに際し、あなたはあなたがコントロールするこの呪文と共通の色を持つアンタップ状態のクリーチャー２体をタップしてもよい。 そうした場合、この呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新たな対象を選んでもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173961&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31e23075-3b42-4d40-b06e-c7031cc18ae7', 'multiverseId': 173961}, 'multiverseid': 173961}, {'name': 'Incendiar Trilha', 'text': 'Incendiar Trilha causa 3 pontos de dano à criatura ou ao jogador alvo.\\nConspirar (Conforme você joga essa mágica, você pode virar duas criaturas desviradas que você controla e que compartilhem uma cor com ela. Quando fizer isso, faça uma cópia dela e você poderá escolher um novo alvo para a cópia.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172155&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f146125f-56d6-415d-862d-7ec74bc37261', 'multiverseId': 172155}, 'multiverseid': 172155}, {'name': 'Выжженный Путь', 'text': 'Выжженный Путь наносит 3 повреждения целевому существу или игроку.\\nЗаговор (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете повернуть два неповернутых существа под вашим контролем, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него. Когда вы это делаете, скопируйте его, и вы можете выбрать новую цель для этой копии.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172456&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a685228e-3d08-4844-ae04-aa8ffb0ee66a', 'multiverseId': 172456}, 'multiverseid': 172456}, {'name': '焚迹', 'text': '焚迹对目标生物或牌手造成3点伤害。\\n协力 （于你使用此咒语时，你可以横置两个由你操控、且与此咒语有共通颜色的未横置生物。 当你如此作，则复制此咒语，且你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173058&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7aa9d8e5-c049-4730-9338-995e5a29d479', 'multiverseId': 173058}, 'multiverseid': 173058}]", '[{\'name\': \'Brustwehr-Posten\', \'text\': \'{W/U}: Der Brustwehr-Posten erhält +0/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kithkin, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Kithkin-Marktflecken ähnelt eher einer Festung als einer Stadt und ist so gebaut, dass er auch andauernder Dunkelheit trotzen kann. Nur die scharfäugigsten und vertrauenswürdigsten Bürger erhalten die Aufgabe, auf den Mauern zu wachen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177798&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8c66e39-117e-4cb4-8916-38d0e929f8f3\', \'multiverseId\': 177798}, \'multiverseid\': 177798}, {\'name\': \'Observadores del parapeto\', \'text\': \'{W/U}: Los Observadores del parapeto obtienen +0/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado kithkin\', \'flavor\': \'Un doun kithkin no es tanto una ciudad como una fortaleza, construida para resistir el asedio constante de la oscuridad. Sólo los más confiables y atentos reciben la responsabilidad de proteger sus muros.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b75d137-8c77-4767-aa77-9ccbc11daf70\', \'multiverseId\': 177822}, \'multiverseid\': 177822}, {\'name\': \'Gardiens du parapet\', \'text\': "{W/U} : Les Gardiens du parapet gagnent +0/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : sangami et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Le doune sangami ressemble moins à un bourg qu\'à une forteresse, construite pour résister aux constants assauts des ténèbres. Seuls les plus loyaux et les plus alertes ont pour tâche de garder leurs remparts.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177869&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4adc788-0f23-4712-8db0-f457acd333a0\', \'multiverseId\': 177869}, \'multiverseid\': 177869}, {\'name\': \'Sentinelle del Parapetto\', \'text\': \'{W/U}: Le Sentinelle del Parapetto prendono +0/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Kithkin\', \'flavor\': "Un doun kithkin non è tanto una città quanto una fortezza, costruita per resistere all\'oscurità in assedio costante. Solo quelli più attenti e degni di fiducia sono incaricati di sorvegliare le sue mura.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ff7b32c-4391-4317-9fec-fbb915ad9661\', \'multiverseId\': 177893}, \'multiverseid\': 177893}, {\'name\': \'胸壁の見張り\', \'text\': \'{W/U}：胸壁の見張りはターン終了時まで＋０/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キスキン・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'キスキンの矮村は村と言うよりは砦で、取り囲む闇に抵抗するべく建てられたものである。 最も用心深く信頼の置ける者のみが、壁の上で見張りの任につく。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177774&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3522b4bb-02d0-4f58-a051-05b9fc2e0bfc\', \'multiverseId\': 177774}, \'multiverseid\': 177774}, {\'name\': \'Vigilantes de Parapeito\', \'text\': \'{W/U}: Vigilantes de Parapeito recebe +0/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kithkin Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Um doun kithkin é mais uma fortaleza do que uma cidade, pois é construído para resistir à escuridão que predomina constantemente. A tarefa de vigiar suas muralhas é conferida somente aos mais atentos e confiáveis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0df3f492-9006-4bb3-9b9e-0a15671d795e\', \'multiverseId\': 177750}, \'multiverseid\': 177750}, {\'name\': \'Дозорные у Парапета\', \'text\': \'{W/U}: Дозорные у Парапета получают +0/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кискен Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Сооруженный для отражения неослабевающего натиска тьмы, кискенский острог больше похож на крепость, чем на город. Только самым бдительным и надежным кискенам поручается охранять его стены.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10943629-2dbc-4ae8-9ff8-850bedd60696\', \'multiverseId\': 177726}, \'multiverseid\': 177726}, {\'name\': \'胸墙看守\', \'text\': \'{W/U}：胸墙看守得+0/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～洁英／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'为了对抗黑暗势力不时的侵扰，洁英小镇都建造得有如要塞一般。 只有眼光最利又最可靠的才能担当守墙重任。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173017&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b899465e-9815-4b08-9ab7-5ca00eb22099\', \'multiverseId\': 173017}, \'multiverseid\': 173017}]', "[{'name': 'Brüllen des Verräters', 'text': 'Tappe eine ungetappte Kreatur deiner Wahl. Sie fügt ihrem Beherrscher Schaden in Höhe ihrer Stärke zu.\\nVerschwören (Sowie du diesen Zauberspruch spielst, kannst du zwei ungetappte Kreaturen tappen, die du kontrollierst und die mindestens eine Farbe mit dem Zauberspruch gemeinsam haben. Wenn du das tust, kopiere den Zauberspruch; du kannst für die Kopie ein neues Ziel bestimmen.)', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174677&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d1ff78e-bd5f-4555-a92c-515f54c3b4f1', 'multiverseId': 174677}, 'multiverseid': 174677}, {'name': 'Rugido del traidor', 'text': 'Gira la criatura objetivo enderezada. Esa criatura hace una cantidad de daño igual a su fuerza a su controlador.\\nConspirar. (En cuanto juegues este hechizo puedes girar dos criaturas enderezadas que controles que compartan un color con él. Cuando lo hagas, cópialo y puedes elegir un nuevo objetivo para la copia.)', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172871&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1fcb8fbf-ade4-4c4e-b1aa-39dde0dbe2c0', 'multiverseId': 172871}, 'multiverseid': 172871}, {'name': 'Rugissement du traître', 'text': 'Engagez la créature dégagée ciblée. Elle inflige à son contrôleur un nombre de blessures égal à sa force.\\nConspiration (Au moment où vous jouez ce sort, vous pouvez engager deux créatures dégagées que vous contrôlez qui partagent une couleur avec lui. Quand vous faites ainsi, copiez-le et vous pouvez choisir une nouvelle cible pour la copie.)', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173473&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dca42a32-bd16-4006-9405-d51f3d579409', 'multiverseId': 173473}, 'multiverseid': 173473}, {'name': 'Ruggito del Traditore', 'text': 'TAPpa una creatura STAPpata bersaglio. Quella creatura infligge danno pari alla propria forza al suo controllore.\\nCospirare (Mentre giochi questa magia, puoi TAPpare due creature STAPpate che controlli che condividono un colore con essa. Quando lo fai, copia la magia. Puoi scegliere un nuovo bersaglio per la copia.)', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173774&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdbe74e5-5172-4c88-80a8-a5547cd4f7e2', 'multiverseId': 173774}, 'multiverseid': 173774}, {'name': '裏切り者の咆哮', 'text': 'アンタップ状態のクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それをタップする。 それはそれのコントローラーに、それのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\\n共謀 （この呪文をプレイするに際し、あなたはあなたがコントロールするこの呪文と共通の色を持つアンタップ状態のクリーチャー２体をタップしてもよい。 そうした場合、この呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新たな対象を選んでもよい。）', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174075&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4265d428-ba3c-400d-9365-1184e91bc9d7', 'multiverseId': 174075}, 'multiverseid': 174075}, {'name': 'Rugido do Traidor', 'text': 'Vire a criatura alvo desvirada. Ela causa ao seu controlador uma quantidade de pontos de dano igual ao seu poder.\\nConspirar (Conforme você joga essa mágica, você pode virar duas criaturas desviradas que você controla e que compartilhem uma cor com ela. Quando fizer isso, faça uma cópia dela e você poderá escolher um novo alvo para a cópia.)', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172269&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b5897d19-1a6f-4d01-ac48-6f22bb5104ee', 'multiverseId': 172269}, 'multiverseid': 172269}, {'name': 'Рев Предателя', 'text': 'Поверните целевое неповернутое существо. Оно наносит количество повреждений, равное своей силе, игроку, под контролем которого оно находится.\\nЗаговор (При разыгрывании этого заклинания вы можете повернуть два неповернутых существа под вашим контролем, у которых есть такой же цвет, как у него. Когда вы это делаете, скопируйте его, и вы можете выбрать новую цель для этой копии.)', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172570&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3db49240-9515-4a62-9181-b1075ee6f734', 'multiverseId': 172570}, 'multiverseid': 172570}, {'name': '叛徒之吼', 'text': '横置目标未横置的生物。 它对其操控者造成等同于其力量的伤害。\\n协力 （于你使用此咒语时，你可以横置两个由你操控、且与此咒语有共通颜色的未横置生物。 当你如此作，则复制此咒语，且你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。）', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173172&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9159a83c-80db-44b7-a546-db933901a070', 'multiverseId': 173172}, 'multiverseid': 173172}]", '[{\'name\': \'Den Brunnen vergiften\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre ein Land deiner Wahl. Den Brunnen vergiften fügt dem Beherrscher dieses Lands 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Brunnen, aus denen man klares und unverseuchtes Wasser schöpfen kann, sind so selten, dass man oft Städte um sie herum baut.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174670&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6ce8d59-b988-4db2-9ca7-04eea6118699\', \'multiverseId\': 174670}, \'multiverseid\': 174670}, {\'name\': \'Envenenar el pozo\', \'text\': \'Destruye la tierra objetivo. Envenenar el pozo hace 2 puntos de daño al controlador de esa tierra.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Los pozos que dan agua limpia son suficientemente valiosos como para construir toda una ciudad alrededor de ellos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172864&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71d1d281-4c16-4477-8c1f-7e404693c265\', \'multiverseId\': 172864}, \'multiverseid\': 172864}, {\'name\': \'Empoisonnement du puits\', \'text\': "Détruisez le terrain ciblé. L\'Empoisonnement du puits inflige 2 blessures au contrôleur de ce terrain.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Les puits qui ont encore de l\'eau non hantée sont assez rares pour qu\'on les entoure d\'une ville.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173466&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba62e78b-0302-4293-8c0b-e12f6e1ab280\', \'multiverseId\': 173466}, \'multiverseid\': 173466}, {\'name\': \'Avvelenare il Pozzo\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una terra bersaglio. Avvelenare il Pozzo infligge 2 danni al controllore di quella terra.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'I pozzi che forniscono acqua fresca e pura sono talmente rari da giustificare qualunque città costruita attorno a essi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173767&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ceb154c-6af6-4210-a7eb-21da75c95dad\', \'multiverseId\': 173767}, \'multiverseid\': 173767}, {\'name\': \'井戸に毒\', \'text\': \'土地１つを対象とし、それを破壊する。 井戸に毒はその土地のコントローラーに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'清らかで呪われていない水の湧く井戸は、それが理由で街ができるほど稀な存在だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'882d13c1-3cfb-4b45-b5be-a3363086f4c9\', \'multiverseId\': 174068}, \'multiverseid\': 174068}, {\'name\': \'Envenenar o Poço\', \'text\': \'Destrua o terreno alvo. Envenenar o Poço causa 2 pontos de dano ao controlador daquele terreno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Os poços que fornecem água límpida e não-assombrada são tão raros que vale a pena construir uma cidade inteira ao redor deles.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'393ba3ef-4dcf-49ea-aafb-563f8b52c547\', \'multiverseId\': 172262}, \'multiverseid\': 172262}, {\'name\': \'Отравление Колодца\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевую землю. Отравление Колодца наносит 2 повреждения игроку, контролирующему ту землю.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Колодцы с чистой водой, нетронутые нечистью, встречаются слишком редко и стоят того, чтобы возвести вокруг них целый город.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef421e03-d4b5-4064-97c7-d0c125a99aef\', \'multiverseId\': 172563}, \'multiverseid\': 172563}, {\'name\': \'井底下毒\', \'text\': \'消灭目标地。 井底下毒对该地的操控者造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'还能提供清净无污染之水的井十分稀有，甚至值得在它周围建立一整座村镇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173165&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4f976c4-7a3a-4e86-b52a-0dbef93bf984\', \'multiverseId\': 173165}, \'multiverseid\': 173165}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Moment auskosten\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst nach diesem Zug einen weiteren Zug. Übergehe das Enttappsegment dieses Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Merrow benötigte einen Augenblick für sich selbst. Sie gab ihn nie zurück.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174527&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d440e94b-1ed1-492e-ba2f-ab51d78a6af4\', \'multiverseId\': 174527}, \'multiverseid\': 174527}, {\'name\': \'Saborear el momento\', \'text\': \'Toma un turno extra después de éste. Sáltate el paso de enderezar de ese turno.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La merrow se tomó un momento para ella. Nunca lo devolvió.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172721&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39dbe3a3-b74f-487d-ba48-d34560d2dc77\', \'multiverseId\': 172721}, \'multiverseid\': 172721}, {\'name\': "Savourer l\'instant", \'text\': "Jouez un autre tour après celui-ci. Passez l\'étape de dégagement de ce tour supplémentaire.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'La suire prit un moment pour se recueillir. Elle ne le rendit jamais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173323&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb703139-a235-4e33-b9af-68b1efbf6324\', \'multiverseId\': 173323}, \'multiverseid\': 173323}, {\'name\': \'Assaporare il Momento\', \'text\': \'Gioca un altro turno dopo questo. Salta lo STAP di quel turno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La merrow si prese un attimo di pausa. E non lo rese più indietro.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173624&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1d126c1-f40d-4b5f-9857-f00d1e00f1d6\', \'multiverseId\': 173624}, \'multiverseid\': 173624}, {\'name\': \'瞬間の味わい\', \'text\': \'このターンの後に追加の１ターンを行う。 そのターンのアンタップ・ステップを飛ばす。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'このメロウは自分のためならたっぷり時間を取る。 返してくれたためしは無い。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f92ac977-aba7-4cec-9c0e-617540ebbe5c\', \'multiverseId\': 173925}, \'multiverseid\': 173925}, {\'name\': \'Saborear o Momento\', \'text\': \'Jogue outro turno após este. Pule a etapa de desvirar daquele turno.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A sirenídea tomou um momento para si mesma. Ela nunca o devolveu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172119&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'86c36b7d-002e-47a7-970d-f506030a88c0\', \'multiverseId\': 172119}, \'multiverseid\': 172119}, {\'name\': \'Наслаждение Моментом\', \'text\': \'Сделайте дополнительный ход вслед за этим. Пропустите шаг разворота в том ходу.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Мерроу осознала всю прелесть момента и решила растянуть удовольствие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b4204a1a-317f-4c07-9059-fe6ef2b4baa7\', \'multiverseId\': 172420}, \'multiverseid\': 172420}, {\'name\': \'品味当下\', \'text\': \'于本回合后进行额外的一个回合。 略过该回合的重置步骤。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'美洛替自己找了些时间。 她没打算要还。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173022&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed608cde-71e8-4964-9e5b-e2d30726c31f\', \'multiverseId\': 173022}, \'multiverseid\': 173022}]', '[{\'name\': \'Den Träumen überlassen\', \'text\': \'Bringe eine bleibende Karte deiner Wahl auf die Hand ihres Besitzers zurück. Falls diese bleibende Karte rot oder grün ist, lege sie stattdessen oben auf die Bibliothek ihres Besitzers.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Träume gehen vorüber. Die Realität ebenfalls." —Oona, Königin der Feen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aabc19eb-36ef-49db-a86d-11eac92645e8\', \'multiverseId\': 174509}, \'multiverseid\': 174509}, {\'name\': \'Entregar al sueño\', \'text\': \'Regresa el permanente objetivo a la mano de su propietario. Si ese permanente es rojo o verde, en vez de eso, ponlo en la parte superior de la biblioteca de su propietario.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Los sueños son efímeros. La realidad lo es aún más." —Oona, reina de las hadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c959ab6f-a930-4e53-afe3-4e1441d3a544\', \'multiverseId\': 172703}, \'multiverseid\': 172703}, {\'name\': \'Expédition dans les rêves\', \'text\': \'Renvoyez le permanent ciblé dans la main de son propriétaire. Si ce permanent est rouge ou vert, mettez-le au-dessus de la bibliothèque de son propriétaire à la place.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Les rêves sont fugaces. La réalité l\'est encore plus. » —Oona, reine des faeries", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173305&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b72869ad-0332-4d9d-a45d-36e391651f6f\', \'multiverseId\': 173305}, \'multiverseid\': 173305}, {\'name\': \'Consegnare in Sogno\', \'text\': \'Fai tornare un permanente bersaglio in mano al suo proprietario. Se quel permanente è rosso o verde, mettilo invece in cima al grimorio del suo proprietario.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"I sogni si stanno muovendo rapidamente. La realtà ancora di più." —Oona, regina degli spiritelli\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbe1b28f-4477-47d6-9655-164b8645e55a\', \'multiverseId\': 173606}, \'multiverseid\': 173606}, {\'name\': \'夢への委託\', \'text\': \'パーマネント１つを対象とし、それをオーナーの手札に戻す。 そのパーマネントが赤か緑である場合、代わりにそれをオーナーのライブラリーの一番上に置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「夢ははかないもの。 現実はなおさらそう。」 ――妖精の女王、ウーナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a86767ab-a599-4f3a-bfff-5da19d8a19c7\', \'multiverseId\': 173907}, \'multiverseid\': 173907}, {\'name\': \'Entregar ao Sonho\', \'text\': \'Devolva a permanente alvo para a mão de seu dono. Se aquela permanente for vermelha ou verde, em vez disso, coloque-a no topo do grimório de seu dono.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Os sonhos são fugazes. A realidade é mais ainda." — Oona, rainha das fadinas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172101&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8e910bbb-6b5e-4dc7-bf2d-22aacbb8194c\', \'multiverseId\': 172101}, \'multiverseid\': 172101}, {\'name\': \'Обречение на Сон\', \'text\': \'Верните целевой перманент в руку его владельца. Если тот перманент красный или зеленый, положите его на верх библиотеки его владельца вместо этого.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Сны быстротечны. Но не более, чем преходящая реальность». — Уна, королева фей\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e690be9-5ca7-4f7c-9adc-d7806aab1275\', \'multiverseId\': 172402}, \'multiverseid\': 172402}, {\'name\': \'托诸梦想\', \'text\': \'将目标永久物移回其拥有者手上。 若该永久物为红色或绿色，则改为将它置于其拥有者的牌库顶。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「梦想不断飞逝； 现实消失得更快。」 ～仙儿女王欧娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173004&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fb658559-065d-438d-b0bb-d588917e64c7\', \'multiverseId\': 173004}, \'multiverseid\': 173004}]', '[{\'name\': \'Die Königin anflehen\', \'text\': \'({2/B} kann mit zwei beliebigen Mana oder mit {B} bezahlt werden. Die umgewandelten Manakosten dieser Karte betragen 6.)\\nDurchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte, deren umgewandelte Manakosten höchstens so hoch sind wie die Anzahl an Ländern, die du kontrollierst, zeige sie offen vor und nimm sie auf deine Hand. Mische danach deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Wer sie hört, wird vor Erleuchtung verrückt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174534&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc8455b9-7262-4849-ba88-8ec6825ce7f3\', \'multiverseId\': 174534}, \'multiverseid\': 174534}, {\'name\': \'Implorar a la reina\', \'text\': \'({2/B} puede pagarse con dos maná cualesquiera o con {B}. El costo de maná convertido de esta carta es 6.)\\nBusca en tu biblioteca una carta con coste de maná convertido menor o igual a la cantidad de tierras que controlas, muéstrala y ponla en tu mano. Luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Aquellos que la escuchan se vuelven locos de inspiración.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172728&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc222611-72f8-4bee-a9fb-003a114dd474\', \'multiverseId\': 172728}, \'multiverseid\': 172728}, {\'name\': \'Implorer la reine\', \'text\': "({2/B} peut être payé au choix avec n\'importe quelle combinaison de deux manas ou avec {B}. Le coût converti de mana de cette carte est 6.)\\nCherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte ayant un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal au nombre de terrains que vous contrôlez, révélez-la et mettez-la dans votre main. Mélangez ensuite votre bibliothèque.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Ceux qui l\'entendent deviennent fou d\'inspiration.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173330&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'412bce6e-ec32-4fd4-8b04-613148e9d9cb\', \'multiverseId\': 173330}, \'multiverseid\': 173330}, {\'name\': \'Supplicare la Regina\', \'text\': \'({2/B} può essere pagato con due mana qualsiasi o con {B}. Il costo di mana convertito di questa carta è 6.)\\nPassa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore al numero di terre che controlli, rivelala e aggiungila alla tua mano. Poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': "Coloro che la ascoltano impazziscono dall\'ispirazione.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173631&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e032bf32-9ba7-44f0-a53b-4ee727a39fe8\', \'multiverseId\': 173631}, \'multiverseid\': 173631}, {\'name\': \'女王への懇願\', \'text\': \'（{2/B}は、任意の２マナか{B}で支払うことができる。 このカードの点数で見たマナ・コストは６である。）\\nあなたのライブラリーから、点数で見たマナ・コストがあなたがコントロールする土地の総数以下であるカードを１枚探し、公開してあなたの手札に加える。 その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の声を聞くものは、霊感に狂ってしまう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f20353e-c82d-4be3-853a-892bd409d066\', \'multiverseId\': 173932}, \'multiverseid\': 173932}, {\'name\': \'Suplicar à Rainha\', \'text\': \'({2/B} pode ser pago com quaisquer dois manas ou com {B}. O custo de mana convertido desse card é 6.)\\nProcure em seu grimório um card com custo de mana convertido menor ou igual ao número de terrenos que você controla, revele-o e coloque-o em sua mão. Depois, embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Aqueles que a ouvem enlouquecem com a inspiração.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172126&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6ccb174f-a315-423c-ba43-907eac16d096\', \'multiverseId\': 172126}, \'multiverseid\': 172126}, {\'name\': \'Взывания к Королеве\', \'text\': \'(За {2/B} можно заплатить две любые маны или {B}. Конвертированная мана-стоимость этой карты равна 6.)\\nНайдите в вашей библиотеке карту с конвертированной мана-стоимостью, меньшей или равной количеству земель под вашим контролем, покажите ее и положите в вашу руку. Затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Услышавшие ее сходят с ума от вдохновения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172427&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'229804b8-6047-42ed-a384-2d38f8dbea2d\', \'multiverseId\': 172427}, \'multiverseid\': 172427}, {\'name\': \'恳求女王\', \'text\': \'（能用任意两点法术力或是{B}来支付{2/B}。 此牌的总法术力费用为6。）\\n从你的牌库中搜寻一张牌，且此牌之总法术力费用需等于或小于由你操控的地之数量，展示该牌，并将它置于你手上。 然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'能听闻她声音者，会因灵感泉涌而发狂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173029&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd4ece72-1c62-4a15-851d-0fbfedb96fa4\', \'multiverseId\': 173029}, \'multiverseid\': 173029}]', "[{'name': 'Diener des Malers', 'text': 'Sowie der Diener des Malers ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nAlle Karten, die nicht im Spiel sind, alle Zaubersprüche und alle bleibenden Karten haben diese Farbe zusätzlich zu ihren anderen Farben.', 'type': 'Artefaktkreatur — Vogelscheuche', 'flavor': 'Er sammelt Schattierungen im Dämmernebel, damit sein Meister eine bessere Welt malen kann.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174734&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1f73eacb-2825-4a84-a13a-f096b504d59f', 'multiverseId': 174734}, 'multiverseid': 174734}, {'name': 'Sirviente del pintor', 'text': 'En cuanto el Sirviente del pintor entre en juego, elige un color.\\nTodas las cartas que no están en juego, hechizos y permanentes son del color elegido además de sus otros colores.', 'type': 'Criatura artefacto — Espantapájaros', 'flavor': 'Recolecta tintes de la niebla del crepúsculo para que su amo pueda pintar un mundo mejor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172928&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48161488-f33f-4b2c-a41c-c61aed22ea45', 'multiverseId': 172928}, 'multiverseid': 172928}, {'name': 'Servant du peintre', 'text': 'Au moment où le Servant du peintre arrive en jeu, choisissez une couleur.\\nToutes les cartes qui ne sont pas en jeu, les sorts et les permanents sont de la couleur choisie en plus de leurs autres couleurs.', 'type': 'Créature-artefact : épouvantail', 'flavor': 'Il récolte des pigments de la brume crépusculaire pour que son maître puisse peindre un monde meilleur.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173530&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '689f7d74-d0a3-47be-9191-e2d0cbcc124c', 'multiverseId': 173530}, 'multiverseid': 173530}, {'name': 'Servo del Pittore', 'text': 'Mentre il Servo del Pittore entra in gioco, scegli un colore.\\nTutte le carte che non sono in gioco, le magie e i permanenti sono del colore scelto in aggiunta ai propri altri colori.', 'type': 'Creatura Artefatto — Spaventapasseri', 'flavor': 'Raccoglie le tinte dalla nebbia serale, affinché il suo padrone possa dipingere un mondo migliore.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173831&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '76b63ddf-6488-4707-82c8-82cc293cc15f', 'multiverseId': 173831}, 'multiverseid': 173831}, {'name': '絵描きの召使い', 'text': '絵描きの召使いが場に出るに際し、色を１色選ぶ。\\nすべての呪文やパーマネントや場に出ていないカードは、自身の色に加えて選ばれた色である。', 'type': 'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — カカシ', 'flavor': 'それが黄昏の霧から色を集めることで、主人は世界をより良い色に染めることができる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174132&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ad58b45-ff5c-4b57-8a9e-c68230df4b3b', 'multiverseId': 174132}, 'multiverseid': 174132}, {'name': 'Servo do Pintor', 'text': 'Conforme Servo do Pintor entra em jogo, escolha uma cor.\\nTodos os cards que não estão em jogo, mágicas e permanentes são da cor escolhida além de suas outras cores.', 'type': 'Criatura Artefato — Espantalho', 'flavor': 'Ele coleta tonalidades das brumas do crepúsculo para que seu mestre possa pintar um mundo melhor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172326&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '434c5005-f7f4-409b-a424-c0fa8fbc2f7e', 'multiverseId': 172326}, 'multiverseid': 172326}, {'name': 'Слуга Живописца', 'text': 'При входе Слуги Живописца в игру выберите цвет.\\nВсе карты, которые не находятся в игре, заклинания и перманенты являются объектами выбранного цвета в дополнение к своим другим цветам.', 'type': 'Артефактное Существо — Пугало', 'flavor': 'Оно собирает краски сумеречного тумана, чтобы его хозяин смог написать ими картину о лучшем мире.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172627&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8cf663fb-1682-4313-9d32-1f902bf3d8e5', 'multiverseId': 172627}, 'multiverseid': 172627}, {'name': '画家仆役', 'text': '于画家仆役进场时，选择一种颜色。\\n所有不在场上的牌，所有咒语，以及所有永久物均额外具有该颜色。', 'type': '神器生物～稻草人', 'flavor': '它从暮色雾气间收集颜色，好让主人画出更好的世界。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173229&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cca9e35b-7958-4440-aac4-e7693cf51fd9', 'multiverseId': 173229}, 'multiverseid': 173229}]", '[{\'name\': \'Distelwollheim-Duo\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen weißen Zauber spielst, erhält das Distelwollheim-Duo +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nImmer wenn du einen blauen Zauber spielst, erhält das Distelwollheim-Duo bis zum Ende des Zuges Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Kithkin, Soldat, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44f5b2f6-536a-4af7-bb62-79f09ad631b2\', \'multiverseId\': 174629}, \'multiverseid\': 174629}, {\'name\': \'Dúo de Flor del Cardo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que juegues un hechizo blanco, el Dúo de Flor del Cardo obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\\nSiempre que juegues un hechizo azul, el Dúo de Flor del Cardo gana la habilidad de volar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero soldado kithkin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172823&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'001e7e55-e900-4c49-92a4-1300755ba6dc\', \'multiverseId\': 172823}, \'multiverseid\': 172823}, {\'name\': \'Duo de Buttechardon\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous jouez un sort blanc, le Duo de Buttechardon gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous jouez un sort bleu, le Duo de Buttechardon acquiert le vol jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : sangami et soldat et sorcier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173425&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c6ea008e-ed7e-4b77-ade2-27154c204375\', \'multiverseId\': 173425}, \'multiverseid\': 173425}, {\'name\': \'Duo di Cardo Appassito\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta giochi una magia bianca, il Duo di Cardo Appassito prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\\nOgniqualvolta giochi una magia blu, il Duo di Cardo Appassito ha volare fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Soldato Kithkin\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173726&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36d37e96-be6c-43c0-8b43-1c0c2becad86\', \'multiverseId\': 173726}, \'multiverseid\': 173726}, {\'name\': \'シスルダウンの二人組\', \'text\': \'あなたが白の呪文をプレイするたび、シスルダウンの二人組はターン終了時まで＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\nあなたが青の呪文をプレイするたび、シスルダウンの二人組はターン終了時まで飛行を得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — キスキン・兵士・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174027&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e6ef6f8-fe91-467d-a50d-c887b654836f\', \'multiverseId\': 174027}, \'multiverseid\': 174027}, {\'name\': \'Duo de Cardovale\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você joga uma mágica branca, Duo de Cardovale recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\\nToda vez que você joga uma mágica azul, Duo de Cardovale ganha voar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Kithkin Soldado Mago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172221&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15649a3-3870-4a9f-944c-0dbb9ef5ddca\', \'multiverseId\': 172221}, \'multiverseid\': 172221}, {\'name\': \'Напарники Чертополошья\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете белое заклинание, Напарники Чертополошья получают +1/+1 до конца хода.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете синее заклинание, Напарники Чертополошья получают Полет до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кискен Солдат Чародей\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'308da071-337e-4339-be35-19dca95de463\', \'multiverseId\': 172522}, \'multiverseid\': 172522}, {\'name\': \'蓟丘搭档\', \'text\': \'每当你使用一个白色咒语时，蓟丘搭档得+1/+1直到回合结束。\\n每当你使用一个蓝色咒语时，蓟丘搭档获得飞行异能直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物～洁英／士兵／法术师\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173124&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9a561fe7-f59f-4ad2-8966-11ebbfd2b3bf\', \'multiverseId\': 173124}, \'multiverseid\': 173124}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornenhüter-Vogelscheuche\', \'text\': \'Die Dornenhüter-Vogelscheuche hat Verdorren, solange du eine grüne Kreatur kontrollierst. (Sie fügt Kreaturen Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken zu.)\\nDie Dornenhüter-Vogelscheuche hat Wachsamkeit, solange du eine weiße Kreatur kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogelscheuche\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174742&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd5a7df6-5fe0-46e0-8f58-0d29f26e2c34\', \'multiverseId\': 174742}, \'multiverseid\': 174742}, {\'name\': \'Espantapájaros espinas atentas\', \'text\': \'El Espantapájaros espinas atentas tiene la habilidad de debilitar mientras controles una criatura verde. (Hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1.)\\nEl Espantapájaros espinas atentas tiene la habilidad de vigilancia mientras controles una criatura blanca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Espantapájaros\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172936&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b8be150-0cf4-49d9-861d-79621047f59b\', \'multiverseId\': 172936}, \'multiverseid\': 172936}, {\'name\': \'Épouvantail gardépine\', \'text\': "L\'Épouvantail gardépine a la flétrissure tant que vous contrôlez une créature verte. (Il inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1.)\\nL\'Épouvantail gardépine a la vigilance tant que vous contrôlez une créature blanche.", \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : épouvantail\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173538&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1a820d7-3f88-44cc-a9bf-61c4c6d24663\', \'multiverseId\': 173538}, \'multiverseid\': 173538}, {\'name\': \'Spaventapasseri Guardiaspina\', \'text\': \'Lo Spaventapasseri Guardiaspina ha avvizzire fintanto che controlli una creatura verde. (Una fonte con avvizzire infligge danno sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1.)\\nLo Spaventapasseri Guardiaspina ha cautela fintanto che controlli una creatura bianca.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Spaventapasseri\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04ac2cdc-5958-43c5-81ac-76a9b0053148\', \'multiverseId\': 173839}, \'multiverseid\': 173839}, {\'name\': \'茨見張りのカカシ\', \'text\': \'茨見張りのカカシは、あなたが緑のクリーチャーをコントロールしているかぎり萎縮を持つ。 （それはクリーチャーに－１/－１カウンターの形でダメージを与える。）\\n茨見張りのカカシは、あなたが白のクリーチャーをコントロールしているかぎり警戒を持つ。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — カカシ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d6934cea-dcfd-4f6c-8fbc-e59c93a5fc29\', \'multiverseId\': 174140}, \'multiverseid\': 174140}, {\'name\': \'Espantalho do Espinho Vigilante\', \'text\': \'Espantalho do Espinho Vigilante terá murchar enquanto você controlar uma criatura verde. (Ele causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1.)\\nEspantalho do Espinho Vigilante terá vigilância enquanto você controlar uma criatura branca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Espantalho\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c27daca5-d956-4452-b946-93d3ad57ef8d\', \'multiverseId\': 172334}, \'multiverseid\': 172334}, {\'name\': \'Остроглазое Пугало\', \'text\': \'Остроглазое Пугало имеет Увядание, пока вы контролируете зеленое существо. (Оно наносит повреждения существам в виде жетонов -1/-1.)\\nОстроглазое Пугало имеет Бдительность, пока вы контролируете белое существо.\', \'type\': \'Артефактное Существо — Пугало\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172635&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'987db724-13c4-4a72-aed4-9a24be5e7a38\', \'multiverseId\': 172635}, \'multiverseid\': 172635}, {\'name\': \'荆守稻草人\', \'text\': \'只要你操控绿色生物，荆守稻草人便具有干枯异能。 （它会以-1/-1指示物的方式对生物造成伤害。）\\n只要你操控白色生物，荆守稻草人便具有警戒异能。\', \'type\': \'神器生物～稻草人\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173237&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73f9f7f4-effa-4db4-93ef-10113e169005\', \'multiverseId\': 173237}, \'multiverseid\': 173237}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dorrschuppenwurm\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Dorrschuppenwurm blockt oder geblockt wird, erhält jene Kreatur Verdorren bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie fügt Kreaturen Schaden in Form von -1/-1-Marken zu.)\\nImmer wenn der Dorrschuppenwurm einem Gegner Schaden zufügt, entferne alle -1/-1-Marken von ihm.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'18aa1449-7ff8-4b10-8cb1-feb6ed2f3d03\', \'multiverseId\': 174611}, \'multiverseid\': 174611}, {\'name\': \'Sierpe escamas debilitadas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que la Sierpe escamas debilitadas bloquee o sea bloqueada por una criatura, esa criatura gana la habilidad de debilitar hasta el final del turno. (Hace daño a las criaturas en forma de contadores -1/-1.)\\nSiempre que la Sierpe escamas debilitadas haga daño a un oponente, remueve todos los contadores -1/-1 de ella.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Sierpe\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172805&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1d81813c-0d32-45d2-aafe-46b94c457f54\', \'multiverseId\': 172805}, \'multiverseid\': 172805}, {\'name\': \'Guivre à écailles flétrissantes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que la Guivre à écailles flétrissantes bloque ou devient bloquée par une créature, cette créature acquiert la flétrissure jusqu\'à la fin du combat. (Elle inflige des blessures aux créatures sous la forme de marqueurs -1/-1.)\\nÀ chaque fois que la Guivre à écailles flétrissantes inflige des blessures à un adversaire, retirez-lui tous les marqueurs -1/-1.", \'type\': \'Créature : guivre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173407&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'972ffb5b-18fb-42ed-919f-fb4718cc8eaf\', \'multiverseId\': 173407}, \'multiverseid\': 173407}, {\'name\': \'Wurm dalle Scaglie Avvizzenti\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Wurm dalle Scaglie Avvizzenti blocca o viene bloccato da una creatura, quella creatura ha avvizzire fino alla fine del turno. (Una fonte con avvizzire infligge danno sotto forma di segnalini -1/-1.)\\nOgniqualvolta il Wurm dalle Scaglie Avvizzenti infligge danno a un avversario, rimuovi da esso tutti i segnalini -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Wurm\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173708&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d074e01-717c-46cd-970d-4ac82da938e1\', \'multiverseId\': 173708}, \'multiverseid\': 173708}, {\'name\': \'萎縮鱗のワーム\', \'text\': \'萎縮鱗のワームがいずれかのクリーチャーをブロックするかいずれかのクリーチャーによってブロックされた状態になるたび、そのクリーチャーはターン終了時まで萎縮を得る。 （それはクリーチャーに－１/－１カウンターの形でダメージを与える。）\\n萎縮鱗のワームがいずれかの対戦相手にダメージを与えるたび、それからすべての－１/－１カウンターを取り除く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ワーム\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174009&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'77a672b1-b5ba-4ebc-b4ab-c361c8ba63fa\', \'multiverseId\': 174009}, \'multiverseid\': 174009}, {\'name\': \'Vorme Escama-Murcha\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Vorme Escama-Murcha bloquear ou for bloqueado por uma criatura, aquela criatura ganhará murchar até o final do turno. (Ela causa dano a criaturas na forma de marcadores -1/-1.)\\nToda vez que Vorme Escama-Murcha causar dano a um oponente, remova todos os marcadores -1/-1 dele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vorme\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8b8d23b9-78f3-41f2-b3d3-418155d03be4\', \'multiverseId\': 172203}, \'multiverseid\': 172203}, {\'name\': \'Вурм Увядания\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Вурм Увядания блокирует или становится заблокирован существом, то существо получает Увядание до конца хода. (Оно наносит повреждения существам в виде жетонов -1/-1.)\\nКаждый раз, когда Вурм Увядания наносит повреждения оппоненту, удалите с него все жетоны -1/-1.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вурм\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f65083b4-b340-4a88-925e-b8ad7ffb5f07\', \'multiverseId\': 172504}, \'multiverseid\': 172504}, {\'name\': \'凋鳞亚龙\', \'text\': \'每当凋鳞亚龙阻挡生物或被生物阻挡时，该生物获得干枯异能直到回合结束。 （它会以-1/-1指示物的方式对生物造成伤害。）\\n每当凋鳞亚龙向对手造成伤害时，移去其上所有的-1/-1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物～亚龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4dd3fc61-4940-40fe-a918-4ff75767c844\', \'multiverseId\': 173106}, \'multiverseid\': 173106}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dragoner des Rabenreviers\', \'text\': \'Der Dragoner des Rabenreviers kann von schwarzen Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich habe eine besondere Gabe. Die Fähigkeit, das Nahen dunkler Kräfte vorherzusagen, hat viele Leben gerettet. Und dennoch ist es eine Bürde, ewig so viel Hässlichkeit spüren zu müssen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174712&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c6fce12-c362-4604-a924-5fa9c002b86e\', \'multiverseId\': 174712}, \'multiverseid\': 174712}, {\'name\': \'Dragón de Coto de Cuervos\', \'text\': \'El Dragón de Coto de Cuervos no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas negras.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Tengo un don. La habilidad para sentir la oscuridad amenazante salvó muchas vidas. Y sin embargo sentir permanentemente la fuerza de tanta fealdad es una carga terrible."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3276047-137e-4941-a2cd-c366a2dbbf7c\', \'multiverseId\': 172906}, \'multiverseid\': 172906}, {\'name\': \'Grognard de la Garenne du Corbeau\', \'text\': \'Le Grognard de la Garenne du Corbeau ne peut pas être bloqué par des créatures noires.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« J\'ai un don, la capacité de sentir les ténèbres approchantes, et cela a sauvé de nombreuses vies. Et pourtant, la présence palpable de tant d\'horreur est un fardeau terrible. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173508&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fae07ff9-952e-4002-bc7a-c89f3b37a395\', \'multiverseId\': 173508}, \'multiverseid\': 173508}, {\'name\': \'Dragone di Volo del Corvo\', \'text\': \'Il Dragone di Volo del Corvo non può essere bloccato dalle creature nere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Ho un dono. La capacità di percepire l\\\'oscurità in arrivo ha salvato molte vite. Eppure il sentire costantemente la forza di questa immensa bruttura è un peso terribile."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffcdefbf-7f54-4521-81b4-fbdaf6c338f1\', \'multiverseId\': 173809}, \'multiverseid\': 173809}, {\'name\': \'レイヴンの地の竜騎兵\', \'text\': \'レイヴンの地の竜騎兵は黒のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「私には力がある。 闇の侵略を知る力は多くの命を救ってきた。 それでも、こうも醜い力を感じ続けることはおぞましい重荷だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21332aac-4557-4b3d-b9e0-da707d5fa665\', \'multiverseId\': 174110}, \'multiverseid\': 174110}, {\'name\': \'Dragão da Toca do Corvo\', \'text\': \'Dragão da Toca do Corvo não pode ser bloqueado por criaturas pretas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu tenho um dom. A habilidade de sentir que a escuridão invasora salvou muitas vidas. No entanto, sentir constantemente a força de tanto horror é um fardo terrível."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc52b111-7e94-4bb8-a5af-a6ace60d6c16\', \'multiverseId\': 172304}, \'multiverseid\': 172304}, {\'name\': \'Драгун Вороновых Угодий\', \'text\': \'Драгун Вороновых Угодий не может быть заблокирован черными существами.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Я обладаю даром. Способность почувствовать наступающую тьму спасла немало жизней. И все же, постоянно ощущать гнетущую силу такого уродства тяжелейшее бремя».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172605&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c6f33fa-9db3-4b47-8ad3-cb0b98aeaf81\', \'multiverseId\': 172605}, \'multiverseid\': 172605}, {\'name\': \'黑鸦地重装兵\', \'text\': \'黑鸦地重装兵不能被黑色生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物～地精／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「我有种天份； 对入侵的黑暗之感受能力已救了好几条性命。 不过时时刻刻感应到如此多的丑恶，也真是可怕的负担。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173207&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78f08694-a53a-4e87-ba93-fe92f9b7d52a\', \'multiverseId\': 173207}, \'multiverseid\': 173207}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dramatischer Auftritt\', \'text\': \'Du kannst eine grüne Kreaturenkarte aus deiner Hand ins Spiel bringen.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bei manchen Dingen lohnt sich das Warten nicht.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174588&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c96416a-8657-4e1a-baac-453126a6f689\', \'multiverseId\': 174588}, \'multiverseid\': 174588}, {\'name\': \'Entrada dramática\', \'text\': \'Puedes poner en juego una carta de criatura verde de tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Por algunas cosas no vale la pena esperar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'053d3922-2719-4a93-98a8-98cb3602762a\', \'multiverseId\': 172782}, \'multiverseid\': 172782}, {\'name\': \'Entrée théâtrale\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez mettre en jeu une carte de créature verte de votre main.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Certaines choses ne valent pas la peine d\'attendre.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173384&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'525063c9-04ba-4add-86c5-5af80a801741\', \'multiverseId\': 173384}, \'multiverseid\': 173384}, {\'name\': \'Entrata Drammatica\', \'text\': \'Puoi mettere in gioco una carta creatura verde dalla tua mano.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Per certe cose non vale la pena aspettare.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173685&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'45c9090f-bde6-46e7-9abe-80e083784532\', \'multiverseId\': 173685}, \'multiverseid\': 173685}, {\'name\': \'劇的な入場\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたの手札にある緑のクリーチャー・カード１枚を場に出してもよい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'待つ甲斐の無い物だってある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173986&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'94f75189-9bc5-4e05-8e38-51100b14e3fa\', \'multiverseId\': 173986}, \'multiverseid\': 173986}, {\'name\': \'Entrada Dramática\', \'text\': \'Você pode colocar em jogo um card de criatura verde da sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Não vale a pena esperar por certas coisas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c21cb654-5138-4d63-8af4-2be842cea178\', \'multiverseId\': 172180}, \'multiverseid\': 172180}, {\'name\': \'Эффектный Выход\', \'text\': \'Вы можете положить карту зеленого существа из вашей руки в игру.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Некоторых вещей не стоит дожидаться слишком долго.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172481&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0abcc1a8-f17b-4319-96df-c32318bed07d\', \'multiverseId\': 172481}, \'multiverseid\': 172481}, {\'name\': \'戏剧性登场\', \'text\': \'你可以将一张绿色生物牌从你手上放置进场。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'有些东西不值得等。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0928c7a7-2a17-40e3-aee6-85a5d5fab465\', \'multiverseId\': 173083}, \'multiverseid\': 173083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dunkle Unterströmungen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine blaue Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du einen Spieler deiner Wahl eine Karte ziehen lassen.\\nImmer wenn eine schwarze Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du einen Spieler deiner Wahl eine Karte abwerfen lassen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174636&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1190681d-f179-411f-ac3e-4037c56fcee8\', \'multiverseId\': 174636}, \'multiverseid\': 174636}, {\'name\': \'Corrientes subterráneas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura azul entre en juego bajo tu control, puedes hacer que el jugador objetivo robe una carta.\\nSiempre que una criatura negra entre en juego bajo tu control, puedes hacer que el jugador objetivo descarte una carta.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb335070-473e-413c-befa-86c8b0048f77\', \'multiverseId\': 172830}, \'multiverseid\': 172830}, {\'name\': \'Courants sous-marins funestes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature bleue arrive en jeu sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez faire que le joueur ciblé pioche une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature noire arrive en jeu sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez faire que le joueur ciblé se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173432&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'973feda2-b75f-4099-92a7-6652d9c617f9\', \'multiverseId\': 173432}, \'multiverseid\': 173432}, {\'name\': \'Correnti Selvagge\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura blu entra in gioco sotto il tuo controllo, puoi far pescare una carta a un giocatore bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura nera entra in gioco sotto il tuo controllo, puoi far scartare una carta a un giocatore bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173733&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63e18f8f-18ca-4b66-afb0-335259c807ce\', \'multiverseId\': 173733}, \'multiverseid\': 173733}, {\'name\': \'恐るべき下層流\', \'text\': \'青のクリーチャーがあなたのコントロール下で場に出るたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは「そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚引く。」を選んでもよい。\\n黒のクリーチャーがあなたのコントロール下で場に出るたび、プレイヤー１人を対象とする。あなたは「そのプレイヤーはカードを１枚捨てる。」を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69e9761b-23e8-4f43-bde8-077626e922b1\', \'multiverseId\': 174034}, \'multiverseid\': 174034}, {\'name\': \'Subcorrentes Medonhas\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura azul entra em jogo sob seu controle, você pode fazer com que o jogador alvo compre um card.\\nToda vez que uma criatura preta entra em jogo sob seu controle, você pode fazer com que o jogador alvo descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172228&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c44d39e6-991e-499b-9778-cc9b7ae2a1c3\', \'multiverseId\': 172228}, \'multiverseid\': 172228}, {\'name\': \'Жестокие Течения\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда синее существо входит в игру под вашим контролем, вы можете заставить целевого игрока взять карту.\\nКаждый раз, когда черное существо входит в игру под вашим контролем, вы можете заставить целевого игрока сбросить карту.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172529&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'daf920a7-3560-4e3b-b01a-2d6fc7f835c0\', \'multiverseId\': 172529}, \'multiverseid\': 172529}, {\'name\': \'湍急暗流\', \'text\': \'每当一个蓝色生物在你的操控下进场时，你可以令目标牌手抓一张牌。\\n每当一个黑色生物在你的操控下进场时，你可以令目标牌手弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173131&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c143f642-11f6-4b85-bc82-bee055cb30d6\', \'multiverseId\': 173131}, \'multiverseid\': 173131}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämmerungsrangen\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn die Dämmerungsrangen angreifen oder blocken, lege eine -1/-1-Marke auf sie.\\nWenn die Dämmerungsrangen aus dem Spiel auf einen Friedhof gelegt werden, ziehe für jede -1/-1-Marke auf ihnen eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Buboh\', \'flavor\': \'Sie tauchen aus den Schatten auf und verbreiten Chaos, bis die Schatten sie wieder verschlucken.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174542&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73aa4b40-d843-4814-a006-21a0b29f5ecf\', \'multiverseId\': 174542}, \'multiverseid\': 174542}, {\'name\': \'Chiquillos del crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Siempre que los Chiquillos del crepúsculo ataquen o bloqueen, pon un contador -1/-1 sobre ellos.\\nCuando los Chiquillos del crepúsculo vayan a un cementerio desde el juego, roba una carta por cada contador -1/-1 sobre ellos.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Oufé\', \'flavor\': \'Emergen de las sombras, creando caos hasta que las sombras los reclaman.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172736&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65b22160-245f-4047-9d69-8bea8f29f103\', \'multiverseId\': 172736}, \'multiverseid\': 172736}, {\'name\': \'Égrillards du crépuscule\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que les Égrillards du crépuscule attaquent ou bloquent, mettez un marqueur -1/-1 sur eux.\\nQuand les Égrillards du crépuscule sont mis dans un cimetière depuis le jeu, piochez une carte pour chaque marqueur -1/-1 sur eux.\', \'type\': \'Créature : orphe\', \'flavor\': "Ils naissent des ombres, semant le chaos jusqu\'à ce que les ombres les rappellent.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173338&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d39b5474-81f7-40e4-adb2-bac701a13abb\', \'multiverseId\': 173338}, \'multiverseid\': 173338}, {\'name\': \'Teppisti del Crepuscolo\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta i Teppisti del Crepuscolo attaccano o bloccano, metti un segnalino -1/-1 su di essi.\\nQuando i Teppisti del Crepuscolo vengono messi in un cimitero dal gioco, pesca una carta per ogni segnalino -1/-1 su di essi.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ouphe\', \'flavor\': "Creati dall\'oscurità, diffondono il caos finché l\'oscurità non li reclama ancora.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173639&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44c47ff5-ac9b-4aa3-9514-b6d0edf934a6\', \'multiverseId\': 173639}, \'multiverseid\': 173639}, {\'name\': \'薄暮の小僧\', \'text\': \'薄暮の小僧が攻撃かブロックするたび、それの上に－１/－１カウンターを１個置く。\\n薄暮の小僧が場からいずれかの墓地に置かれたとき、それの上に置かれていた－１/－１カウンター１個につき１枚カードを引く。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — アウフ\', \'flavor\': \'それは影から生まれ、影がそれを再び手に入れるまで混沌を撒き散らす。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173940&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'49e905fb-9b69-4c10-8168-b8e68df9562d\', \'multiverseId\': 173940}, \'multiverseid\': 173940}, {\'name\': \'Diabinhos do Crepúsculo\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Diabinhos do Crepúsculo atacar ou bloquear, coloque um marcador -1/-1 nele.\\nQuando Diabinhos do Crepúsculo for colocado no cemitério vindo do jogo, compre um card para cada marcador -1/-1 nele.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Eles brotam das sombras e geram caos até que as sombras os chamem novamente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172134&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d75789a-d1ce-4157-90f4-a7e797e9ff9a\', \'multiverseId\': 172134}, \'multiverseid\': 172134}, {\'name\': \'Сумеречные Урчины\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Сумеречные Урчины атакуют или блокируют, положите на них один жетон -1/-1.\\nКогда Сумеречные Урчины попадают из игры на кладбище, возьмите одну карту за каждый жетон -1/-1 на них.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Уф\', \'flavor\': \'Они рождаются из тени, сея хаос вокруг до тех пор, пока тень снова не призовет их.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a10d6da7-c757-4a93-8975-73572ffb8c68\', \'multiverseId\': 172435}, \'multiverseid\': 172435}, {\'name\': \'薄暮促狭鬼\', \'text\': \'每当薄暮促狭鬼攻击或阻挡时，于其上放置一个-1/-1指示物。\\n当薄暮促狭鬼从场上置入坟墓场时，其上每有一个-1/-1指示物，便抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'生物～奥夫\', \'flavor\': \'他们诞生自黯影，不断制造浑沌，终而重归黯影。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a567bd1a-749a-4b37-a350-e4fb6f28ad61\', \'multiverseId\': 173037}, \'multiverseid\': 173037}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsterlanze\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine Kreatur deiner Wahl. Falls diese Kreatur grün oder weiß war, wirft ihr Beherrscher eine Karte aus der Hand ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Jedes Opfer stirbt nur einmal, doch die Hinterbliebenen fühlen den Schmerz bei jeder Erinnerung neu.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174544&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9d6432d-9221-4d13-8511-49a16689317b\', \'multiverseId\': 174544}, \'multiverseid\': 174544}, {\'name\': \'Lanza lúgubre\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo. Si esa criatura era verde o blanca, su controlador descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'La muerte toca a su víctima sólo una vez, pero aquellos que quedan atrás sienten el dolor de la pérdida con cada recuerdo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172738&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6edaa68-9354-4dd1-8d80-dd140e8c2b34\', \'multiverseId\': 172738}, \'multiverseid\': 172738}, {\'name\': \'Lance de noirceur\', \'text\': "Détruisez la créature ciblée. Si cette créature était verte ou blanche, son contrôleur se défausse d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "La mort ne frappe sa victime qu\'une fois, mais ceux qui restent souffrent avec chaque souvenir de cette perte.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173340&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ec27e73-7173-4b3a-a049-227b396a7962\', \'multiverseId\': 173340}, \'multiverseid\': 173340}, {\'name\': \'Lancia di Tenebra\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio. Se quella creatura era verde o bianca, il suo controllore scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'La morte colpisce le vittime una sola volta, ma i loro cari sentono il dolore della perdita in ogni ricordo del caduto.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'638e6f29-0e96-49f3-9213-9b9c3f3a7141\', \'multiverseId\': 173641}, \'multiverseid\': 173641}, {\'name\': \'憂鬱の槍\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。 そのクリーチャーが白か緑である場合、それのコントローラーはカードを１枚捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'死が獲物を刺すのは一度だけだが、残された者達は、思い出が通り過ぎるたびに失ったものへの苦痛を感じ続ける。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad0a77ee-ea78-4620-9fb7-97bf71d38b75\', \'multiverseId\': 173942}, \'multiverseid\': 173942}, {\'name\': \'Lança das Trevas\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo. Se aquela criatura for verde ou branca, seu controlador descartará um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'A morte aferroa a vítima apenas uma vez, mas os que ficam sentem a dor da perda a cada recordação.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172136&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f238b97-32fa-4574-8f18-60f76a23e820\', \'multiverseId\': 172136}, \'multiverseid\': 172136}, {\'name\': \'Копье Мрака\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо. Если то существо было зеленым или белым, контролирующий его игрок сбрасывает карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Смерть пронзает жертву один лишь раз, но те, кто остается позади, чувствуют боль потери при каждом воспоминании.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3706760f-5d4b-4e2b-b3ea-b4aaa293024d\', \'multiverseId\': 172437}, \'multiverseid\': 172437}, {\'name\': \'阴暗矛刺\', \'text\': \'消灭目标生物。 如果该生物是绿色或白色，则其操控者弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'死亡只让遭难者痛苦一次，而每个逝去的记忆却让幸存者不断感受失落之苦痛。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173039&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3952819-638a-42ed-86d9-26f4f1e36620\', \'multiverseId\': 173039}, \'multiverseid\': 173039}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düsterwitwe\', \'text\': \'Reichweite\\nDie Düsterwitwe kann Kreaturen ohne Flugfähigkeit nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Spinne\', \'flavor\': \'Wenn Düsterwitwen heranwachsen, verlieren sie ihr Gift und spannen dafür Netze, die sich von einer Klippe zur nächsten spannen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=174594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9bc21d1b-35b0-449a-b784-c1979d210298\', \'multiverseId\': 174594}, \'multiverseid\': 174594}, {\'name\': \'Viuda lúgubre\', \'text\': \'Alcance.\\nLa Viuda lúgubre no puede bloquear criaturas sin la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Araña\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando las viudas lúgubres maduran abandonan el veneno y se dedican a telarañas enormes que cubren precipicios.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172788&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6b162b8-26fd-4ecb-ad92-5c27b531287d\', \'multiverseId\': 172788}, \'multiverseid\': 172788}, {\'name\': \'Veuve obscure\', \'text\': \'Portée\\nLa Veuve obscure ne peut pas bloquer les créatures sans le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : araignée\', \'flavor\': "Quand les veuves obscures atteignent l\'âge adulte, elles abandonnent leur venin pour lui préférer d\'immenses toiles qui s\'étirent entre les falaises.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173390&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe20893d-325c-4628-8fa7-629bd5cadfd4\', \'multiverseId\': 173390}, \'multiverseid\': 173390}, {\'name\': \'Vedova di Tenebra\', \'text\': \'Raggiungere\\nLa Vedova di Tenebra non può bloccare le creature senza volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Ragno\', \'flavor\': \'Quando le vedove di tenebra maturano, abbandonano il veleno in favore di grandi ragnatele che abbracciano picchi di scogli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173691&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93baa94b-7bc6-46b9-8ef5-761b8e1911e6\', \'multiverseId\': 173691}, \'multiverseid\': 173691}, {\'name\': \'鬱後家蜘蛛\', \'text\': \'到達\\n鬱後家蜘蛛では飛行を持たないクリーチャーをブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'鬱後家蜘蛛は成熟すると、崖の下に巨大な巣を張る代償として毒を失う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97bc9b41-a63d-4eb1-9375-5e90f4b0c2d8\', \'multiverseId\': 173992}, \'multiverseid\': 173992}, {\'name\': \'Viúva-Sombria\', \'text\': \'Alcance\\nViúva-Sombria não pode bloquear criaturas sem voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Aranha\', \'flavor\': \'Quando as viúvas-sombrias crescem, elas abandonam seu veneno em favor das enormes teias que se espalham pelos cumes dos penhascos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172186&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d291ad79-6a30-4d11-a474-4b1daac81ea4\', \'multiverseId\': 172186}, \'multiverseid\': 172186}, {\'name\': \'Мрачная Вдова\', \'text\': \'Захват\\nМрачная Вдова не может блокировать существа без Полета.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Паук\', \'flavor\': \'Когда мрачные вдовы взрослеют, они перестают убивать ядом, предпочитая огромные сети, опутывающие расселины в утесах.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=172487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cdea61e4-9863-4b3e-959f-49652f30a07b\', \'multiverseId\': 172487}, \'multiverseid\': 172487}, {\'name\': \'暗寡妇\', \'text\': \'延势\\n暗寡妇不能阻挡不具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'生物～蜘蛛\', \'flavor\': \'当暗寡妇长成后，便不再仰赖毒素，而是编结横跨山崖的广大蛛网。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=173089&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'68dcfa16-f990-4b24-8cc3-911562c7309e\', \'multiverseId\': 173089}, \'multiverseid\': 173089}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177802&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '2d1408e5-c870-4e69-8726-67543e72d661', 'multiverseId': 177802}, 'multiverseid': 177802}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177826&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '501b18fd-50c1-4a5d-8318-bfb559308a7a', 'multiverseId': 177826}, 'multiverseid': 177826}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177873&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '598fe770-9815-4576-ac9b-23f91dd47a7b', 'multiverseId': 177873}, 'multiverseid': 177873}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177897&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '60530a9e-957c-418f-ac23-1902e4363ff9', 'multiverseId': 177897}, 'multiverseid': 177897}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177778&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5a2e5035-6c92-4f72-adbb-a4df81417c3d', 'multiverseId': 177778}, 'multiverseid': 177778}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177754&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41a94e89-dbb4-451e-9c39-b75192c25586', 'multiverseId': 177754}, 'multiverseid': 177754}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177730&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '34f16884-41c0-4321-81c4-3479801e1de1', 'multiverseId': 177730}, 'multiverseid': 177730}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=177849&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '8aea0a7b-b408-4ab7-a986-c51aaef00d44', 'multiverseId': 177849}, 'multiverseid': 177849}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/H