original_text: ["({2\\nB} can be paid with any two mana or with {B}. This card's converted mana cost is 6.)\\nSearch your library for a card with converted mana cost less than or equal to the number of lands you control, reveal it, and put it into your hand. Then shuffle your library.", '({2\\nG} can be paid with any two mana or with {G}. This card\'s converted mana cost is 6.)\\nUntil end of turn, target creature gets +4/+4 and gains trample, wither, and "When this creature attacks, target creature blocks it this turn if able." (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', "({2\\nR} can be paid with any two mana or with {R}. This card's converted mana cost is 6.)\\nFlame Javelin deals 4 damage to target creature or player.", "({2\\nU} can be paid with any two mana or with {U}. This card's converted mana cost is 6.)\\nLook at the top five cards of your library. If you control more creatures than any other player, put two of those cards into your hand. Otherwise, put one of them into your hand. Then put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.", "({2\\nW} can be paid with any two mana or with {W}. This card's converted mana cost is 10.)\\nOther Scarecrow creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever another Scarecrow comes into play under your control, destroy target permanent.", "({2\\nW} can be paid with any two mana or with {W}. This card's converted mana cost is 6.)\\nPut three 1/1 white Spirit creature tokens with flying into play.", '({T}: Add {B} to your mana pool.)\\nLeechridden Swamp comes into play tapped.\\n{B}, {T}: Each opponent loses 1 life. Play this ability only if you control two or more black permanents.', '({T}: Add {G} to your mana pool.)\\nSapseep Forest comes into play tapped.\\n{G}, {T}: You gain 1 life. Play this ability only if you control two or more green permanents.', '({T}: Add {R} to your mana pool.)\\nMadblind Mountain comes into play tapped.\\n{R}, {T}: Shuffle your library. Play this ability only if you control two or more red permanents.', "({T}: Add {U} to your mana pool.)\\nMoonring Island comes into play tapped.\\n{U}, {T}: Look at the top card of target player's library. Play this ability only if you control two or more blue permanents.", '({T}: Add {W} to your mana pool.)\\nMistveil Plains comes into play tapped.\\n{W}, {T}: Put target card in your graveyard on the bottom of your library. Play this ability only if you control two or more white permanents.', 'Add two mana in any combination of colors to your mana pool.\\nDraw a card.', 'All permanents are enchantments in addition to their other types.', 'As Lurebound Scarecrow comes into play, choose a color.\\nWhen you control no permanents of the chosen color, sacrifice Lurebound Scarecrow.', "As Painter's Servant comes into play, choose a color.\\nAll cards that aren't in play, spells, and permanents are the chosen color in addition to their other colors.", "As Runed Halo comes into play, name a card.\\nYou have protection from the chosen name. (You can't be targeted, dealt damage, or enchanted by anything with that name.)", "As an additional cost to play Rite of Consumption, sacrifice a creature.\\nRite of Consumption deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to target player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.", 'As an additional cost to play Scarscale Ritual, put a -1/-1 counter on a creature you control.\\nDraw two cards.', 'Ashenmoor Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another black creature.', "Ashenmoor Gouger can't block.", 'At end of turn, if an opponent lost 3 or more life this turn, you may draw a card. (Damage causes loss of life.)', "At the beginning of each player's draw step, that player draws a card.\\nWhenever a player draws a card, Spiteful Visions deals 1 damage to that player.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, if you have no cards in hand, each opponent loses 2 life.\\nAt the beginning of each opponent's upkeep, if that player has no cards in hand, he or she loses 2 life.", "At the beginning of your upkeep, remove a -1/-1 counter from each creature you control.\\nPersist (When this creature is put into a graveyard from play, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to play under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you may exchange control of target nonland permanent you control and target nonland permanent an opponent controls with an equal or lesser converted mana cost.', 'At the end of each turn, each opponent loses life equal to the life he or she lost this turn. (Damage causes loss of life.)', 'B', "Barrenton Cragtreads can't be blocked by red creatures.", 'Black creatures you control have wither. (They deal damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Blazethorn Scarecrow has haste as long as you control a red creature.\\nBlazethorn Scarecrow has wither as long as you control a green creature. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Blue creatures you control are unblockable.', 'Burn Trail deals 3 damage to target creature or player.\\nConspire (As you play this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)', 'Chainbreaker comes into play with two -1/-1 counters on it.\\n{3}, {T}: Remove a -1/-1 counter from target creature.', 'Choose one Target player discards two cards; or target player reveals his or her hand, you choose a card from it, then that player discards that card.', 'Choose three target nonenchantment permanents. Destroy one of them at random.', 'Corrupt deals damage equal to the number of Swamps you control to target creature or player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Counter target blue instant spell.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1} for each blue permanent you control.', "Counter target spell. Search its controller's graveyard, hand, and library for all cards with the same name as that spell and remove them from the game. Then that player shuffles his or her library.", 'Counter target spell. You may shuffle up to one target card from your graveyard into your library.', 'Crabapple Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another green creature.', "Creatures target player controls can't block this turn. Ember Gale deals 1 damage to each white and/or blue creature that player controls.", 'Creatures you control have double strike.', "Deep-Slumber Titan comes into play tapped.\\nDeep-Slumber Titan doesn't untap during your untap step.\\nWhenever Deep-Slumber Titan is dealt damage, untap it.", 'Destroy all Auras and Equipment attached to target creature.', 'Destroy all artifacts and enchantments. You gain 2 life for each permanent destroyed this way.', 'Destroy all nonwhite creatures.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.\\nConspire (As you play this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it and you may choose a new target for the copy.)', "Destroy target artifact. Smash to Smithereens deals 3 damage to that artifact's controller.", 'Destroy target creature with flying. If that creature was blue or black, put a 1/2 green Spider creature token with reach into play. (It can block creatures with flying.)', 'Destroy target creature. If that creature was green or white, its controller discards a card.', "Destroy target land. Poison the Well deals 2 damage to that land's controller.", 'Draw a card for each Island you control.', 'Draw cards equal to the number of cards target opponent discarded this turn.', 'Draw two cards, then discard a card.\\nConspire (As you play this spell, you may tap two untapped creatures you control that share a color with it. When you do, copy it.)', "Drove of Elves's power and toughness are each equal to the number of green permanents you control.\\nDrove of Elves can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.", 'Each other creature becomes a copy of target nonlegendary creature until end of turn.', 'Enchant creature\\nAs long as enchanted creature is black, it gets +1/+1 and has wither. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nAs long as enchanted creature is red, it gets +1/+1 and has first strike.', 'Enchant creature\\nAs long as enchanted creature is blue, it gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature deals damage to an opponent, draw a card."\\nAs long as enchanted creature is black, it gets +1/+1 and has "Whenever this creature deals damage to an opponent, that player discards a card."', 'Enchant creature\\nAs long as enchanted creature is green, it gets +1/+1 and is indestructible. (Lethal damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it. If its toughness is 0 or less, it\'s still put into its owner\'s graveyard.)\\nAs long as enchanted creature is white, it gets +1/+1 and has flying.', 'Enchant creature\\nAs long as enchanted creature is red, it gets +1/+1 and has double strike. (It deals both first-strike and regular combat damage.)\\nAs long as enchanted creature is green, it gets +1/+1 and has trample.', 'Enchant creature\\nAs long as enchanted creature is white, it gets +1/+1 and has lifelink. (Whenever it deals damage, its controller gains that much life.)\\nAs long as enchanted creature is blue, it gets +1/+1 and is unblockable.', 'Enchant creature\\nAt the beginning of each upkeep, tap enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature attacks each turn if able.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block and its activated abilities can't be played.\\nWhenever a creature comes into play under an opponent's control, you may attach Prison Term to that creature.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature doesn\'t untap during its controller\'s untap step.\\nEnchanted creature has "{1}, Put a -1/-1 counter on this creature: Untap this creature."', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Plains you control and has flying.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: Put X 1/1 red Elemental creature tokens with haste into play, where X is this creature\'s power. Remove them from the game at end of turn."', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: Put a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token into play."', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature has "{T}: This creature deals 1 damage to target creature or player."', 'Enchant creature\\nYou control enchanted creature.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, put a -1/-1 counter on enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\\n{1}{B}: Put a -1/-1 counter on enchanted creature.', "Enchant player\\nIf a card would be put into enchanted player's graveyard from anywhere, instead that card is revealed and put on the bottom of that player's library.", 'Equipped creature gets +1/+0 and has wither. (It deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nEquip {2}', 'Equipped creature has "{3}, {Q}: This creature gets +2/+2 until end of turn." ({Q} is the untap symbol.)\\nEquip {0}', "Fear\\nCrowd of Cinders's power and toughness are each equal to the number of black permanents you control.", 'Fear\\n{2}{U}{B}: Each unblocked creature becomes 4/1 until end of turn.', 'Firespout deals 3 damage to each creature without flying if {R} was spent to play Firespout and 3 damage to each creature with flying if {G} was spent to play it. (Do both if {R}{G} was spent.)', 'First strike\\nBallynock Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another white creature.', 'First strike\\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Flash', 'Flash\\nEnchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -3/-0.', 'Flash\\nFlying, defender', 'Flash\\nFlying\\nWhen Glamer Spinners comes into play, attach all Auras enchanting target permanent to another permanent with the same controller.', 'Flash\\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther blue creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Flash\\nWhen Prismwake Merrow comes into play, target permanent becomes the color or colors of your choice until end of turn.', 'Flying', 'Flying, defender\\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Flying, haste\\nWhen you play Demigod of Revenge, return all cards named Demigod of Revenge from your graveyard to play.', "Flying, vigilance\\nWhen Twilight Shepherd comes into play, return to your hand all cards in your graveyard put there from play this turn.\\nPersist (When this creature is put into a graveyard from play, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to play under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Flying\\nAttacking creatures you control have lifelink.', 'Flying\\nBriarberry Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another blue creature.', 'Flying\\nDiscard Faerie Macabre: Remove up to two target cards in graveyards from the game.', "Flying\\nFaerie Swarm's power and toughness are each equal to the number of blue permanents you control.", "Flying\\nIf a source would deal damage to Swans of Bryn Argoll, prevent that damage. The source's controller draws cards equal to the damage prevented this way.", 'Flying\\nOther blue creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther black creatures you control get +1/+1.', 'Flying\\nOther creatures are 1/1.', "Flying\\nTatterkite can't have counters placed on it.", 'Flying\\nWhen Knollspine Dragon comes into play, you may discard your hand and draw cards equal to the damage dealt to target opponent this turn.', "Flying\\nWhen Puppeteer Clique comes into play, put target creature card in an opponent's graveyard into play under your control. It has haste. At the end of your turn, remove it from the game.\\nPersist (When this creature is put into a graveyard from play, if it had no -1/-1 counters on it, return it to play under its owner's control with a -1/-1 counter on it.)", 'Flying\\nWhenever Goldenglow Moth blocks, you may gain 4 life.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Kinscaer Harpoonist attacks, you may have target creature lose flying until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)\\nCreatures your opponents control with counters on them can't attack or block.", 'Flying\\n{1}{U}, {Q}: Target opponent removes the top card of his or her library from the game. Until end of turn, you may play that card. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Flying\\n{1}{WU}, {Q}: Tap target creature. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Flying\\n{2}, {Q}: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Flying\\n{BR}: Blistering Dieflyn gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{RW}{RW}: Rune-Cervin Rider gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{X}{UB}: Choose a color. Target opponent removes the top X cards of his or her library from the game. For each card of the chosen color removed this way, put a 1/1 blue and black Faerie Rogue creature token with flying into play.', 'G', 'Ghastlord of Fugue is unblockable.\\nWhenever Ghastlord of Fugue deals combat damage to a player, that player reveals his or her hand. Choose a card from it. That player removes that card from the game.', 'Green creatures you control have trample.', 'Grief Tyrant comes into play with four -1/-1 counters on it.\\nWhen Grief Tyrant is put into a graveyard from play, put a -1/-1 counter on target creature for each -1/-1 counter on Grief Tyrant.', 'Grim Poppet comes into play with three -1/-1 counters on it.\\nRemove a -1/-1 counter from Grim Poppet: Put a -1/-1 counter on another target creature.', 'Haste\\nMudbrawler Cohort gets +1/+1 as long as you control another red creature.', 'Haste\\nWither (This deals damage to creatures in the form of -1/-1 counters.)', 'Haste\\n{R}: Pyre Charger gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Haste\\n{T}: Target black or red creature gains haste until end of turn.', "Horde of Boggarts's power and toughness are each equal to the number of red permanents you control.\\nHorde of Boggarts can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.", 'If Mossbridge Troll would be destroyed, regenerate it.\\nTap any number of untapped creatures you control other than Mossbridge Troll with total power 10 or greater: Mossbridge Troll gets +20/+20 until end of turn.', 'If you tap a permanent for mana, it produces twice as much of that mana instead.', 'If you would draw a card, draw two cards instead.', 'If you would gain life, you gain twice that much life instead.', "If {U} was spent to play River's Grasp, return up to one target creature to its owner's hand. If {B} was spent to play River's Grasp, target player reveals his or her hand, you choose a nonland card from it, then that player discards that card. (Do both if {U}{B} was spent.)", "Inkfathom Infiltrator can't block and is unblockable.", 'Jaws of Stone deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of target creatures and/or players, where X is the number of Mountains you control as you play Jaws of Stone.', 'Lands you control are every basic land type in addition to their other types.', 'Leech Bonder comes into play with two -1/-1 counters on it.\\n{U}, {Q}: Move a counter from target creature onto another target creature. ({Q} is the untap symbol.)', 'Lifelink, protection from converted mana cost 3 or greater', 'Morselhoarder comes into play with two -1/-1 counters on it.\\nRemove a -1/-1 counter from Morselhoarder: Add one mana of any color to your mana pool.', 'Move all counters from target creature onto another target creature.', "Mudbrawler Raiders can't be blocked by blue creatures.", 'Other black creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther red creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever Ashenmoor Liege becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, that player loses 4 life.', 'Other enchantments you control have shroud.\\nEnchanted creatures you control have shroud.', 'Other green creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nOther white creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nIf a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard Wilt